    "summary": "这是一个面向“3D Website”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 fine atmospheric grain，并以“keyboard-accessible carousel motion”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合 3D Website 类官网首屏、活动主视觉、作品集入口或产品发布页。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement a designer-toy release built around a rotatable figurine, edition chips, material callouts, and a collector waitlist. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nENGINEERING SCOPE\nImplement with React 19, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS v4, motion/react, and lucide-react. Keep the component tree typed and frontend-only.\nReference scope: a high-impact hero section with navigation, a concise value proposition, primary and secondary actions, and a visual focal point. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nCOMPOSITION AND TYPE\n- Compose the page with a full-viewport opening composition; express that structure through fine atmospheric grain.\n- Turn #F4845F, #F79B7F, #6BBF7A, #85CC92 into named CSS design tokens; use Inter to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1440px content width, a highly structured spacing rhythm, and roughly 24px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nPAGE SEQUENCE\n1. Concentrate the opening viewport on a designer-toy release built around a rotatable figurine, edition chips, material callouts, and a collector waitlist, with one dominant promise, supporting explanation, primary action, secondary route, and visual proof.\n2. Expose just enough adjacent content to signal what follows; do not turn the hero into a generic feature dashboard or duplicate the same message in multiple cards.\n3. The value proposition and primary action must remain complete when decorative media and advanced motion are unavailable.\n\nMOTION DIRECTION\n- Use keyboard-accessible carousel motion, purposeful hover feedback, lightweight 3D-inspired depth to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 220–320ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Limit simultaneous animation layers, pause media outside the viewport, and reserve emphasis motion for the element that changed state.\n- Maintain logical keyboard order and visible focus through every transition; prefers-reduced-motion should produce an equally legible non-animated path.\n\nMOBILE AND DESKTOP\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nSHIP CRITERIA\n- Ensure WCAG AA contrast, semantic structure, accessible control names, visible focus, and text equivalents for any information-bearing visual.\n- Complete a release pass for navigation, forms, media fallback, long content, error recovery, and runtime console health.\n- Deliver reusable typed code, shared tokens, no speculative services, and a short README that records desktop, tablet, mobile, and reduced-motion checks.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现围绕可旋转设计师玩偶、版本标签、材质标注和收藏候补名单展开的潮玩发布页。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n工程范围\n使用 React 19、TypeScript、Vite、Tailwind CSS v4、motion/react 和 lucide-react 实现；组件树保持强类型且仅包含前端能力。\n参考范围：包含导航、精炼价值主张、主次操作和视觉焦点的高冲击首屏。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n构图与字体\n- 主体构图采用占满首屏的开场构图；视觉语言由细腻氛围颗粒构成。\n- 把 #F4845F, #F79B7F, #6BBF7A, #85CC92 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1440px，采用高度结构化的间距节奏，基础圆角约 24px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n页面序列\n1. 把首屏集中在围绕可旋转设计师玩偶、版本标签、材质标注和收藏候补名单展开的潮玩发布页，包含一个主承诺、支持解释、主操作、次级路径和视觉证明。\n2. 只露出足够的后续内容提示页面走向，不要把首屏做成通用功能仪表盘，也不要在多张卡片里重复同一信息。\n3. 装饰媒体和高级动画不可用时，价值主张与主操作仍必须完整成立。\n\n动态方向\n- 使用支持键盘操作的轮播动画、有明确意图的悬停反馈、轻量 3D 景深突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 220–320ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 限制同时运行动画的层数，暂停视口外媒体，只让发生状态变化的元素获得强调。\n- 所有过渡保持合理键盘顺序和可见焦点；prefers-reduced-motion 提供同样清晰的无动画路径。\n\n手机与桌面\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n交付条件\n- 确保 WCAG AA 对比度、语义结构、控件可访问名称、可见焦点，以及信息型视觉的文字等价内容。\n- 完成导航、表单、媒体回退、长内容、错误恢复和控制台健康的发布检查。\n- 交付可复用强类型代码、共享令牌、不引入推测性服务，并在 README 记录桌面、平板、手机和减少动态效果检查。"
