    "prompt": "Design and implement a character artist portfolio where an oversized 3D portrait, project reel, model-turnaround view, and contact invitation lead the narrative. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nIMPLEMENTATION CONTRACT\nStart from React 19, TypeScript, and Vite. Compose responsive styles with Tailwind CSS v4, interaction motion with motion/react, and icons with lucide-react.\nReference scope: a complete landing page with a focused hero, trust evidence, benefits, product proof, conversion section, and footer. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nVISUAL READING\n- Compose the page with an asymmetric split layout; a full-viewport opening composition; a centered focal composition; express that structure through dark high-contrast palette; bright neutral canvas; subtle directional gradients.\n- Turn #0C0C0C, #646973, #BBCCD7, #D7E2EA into named CSS design tokens; use a modern grotesk with an editorial serif accent to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1240px content width, an editorially paced spacing rhythm, and roughly 16px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nEXPERIENCE BLUEPRINT\n1. Shape the narrative around a character artist portfolio where an oversized 3D portrait, project reel, model-turnaround view, and contact invitation lead the narrative, moving from a distinctive point of view to concrete work, role clarity, evidence, and contact.\n2. Let imagery and project detail carry the proof; avoid fake client-logo walls, unsupported awards, or decorative capability grids.\n3. Give every case or chapter a clear entry and exit so the page reads coherently with motion disabled.\n\nMOTION CHOREOGRAPHY\n- Use scroll-linked progression, a continuously looping marquee, a restrained pointer-following effect to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 320–520ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Use motion to connect cause and effect, not to decorate idle space; selected, loading, success, and error transitions must remain unambiguous.\n- Provide equivalent keyboard behavior and persistent focus styling, and make prefers-reduced-motion a first-class static composition rather than an afterthought.\n\nRESPONSIVE TRANSFORMATION\n- Preserve the asymmetric split on desktop; narrow the media column at tablet width, then reorder mobile as message, primary action, media, supporting content.\n- At 1440px, 768px, and 360px there must be no horizontal overflow; touch targets stay at least 44px and media keeps its intended aspect ratio.\n\nACCEPTANCE CHECKS\n- Apply WCAG AA to text and controls, preserve source order, label every input, and provide meaningful alternative text only where imagery carries information.\n- Test all calls to action, external routes, expandable regions, and failure fallbacks; the finished interface must produce no clipping or runtime errors.\n- Keep data and presentation typed, consolidate repeated styles, and include a README with setup plus responsive and reduced-motion verification.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现以超大 3D 人物肖像、项目短片、模型环视和合作邀请为叙事主线的角色艺术家作品集。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n实施约束\n从 React 19、TypeScript 和 Vite 开始，以 Tailwind CSS v4 组织响应式样式、motion/react 处理交互动画、lucide-react 提供图标。\n参考范围：包含聚焦首屏、信任证据、收益、产品证明、转化区和页脚的完整落地页。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n视觉解读\n- 主体构图采用非对称分栏布局、占满首屏的开场构图、居中的视觉焦点构图；视觉语言由深色高对比配色、明亮中性画布、细微方向性渐变构成。\n- 把 #0C0C0C, #646973, #BBCCD7, #D7E2EA 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 现代 Grotesk 字体，辅以编辑感衬线字体 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1240px，采用具有编辑节奏的间距节奏，基础圆角约 16px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n体验结构\n1. 围绕以超大 3D 人物肖像、项目短片、模型环视和合作邀请为叙事主线的角色艺术家作品集组织叙事，从鲜明观点推进到具体作品、角色说明、证据和联系入口。\n2. 让图像和项目细节承担证明，避免虚假客户徽标、无依据奖项或装饰性能力网格。\n3. 每个案例或章节都要有清楚入口与出口，关闭动画后页面仍能连贯阅读。\n\n动画编排\n- 使用与滚动进度联动的动画、连续循环跑马灯、克制的指针跟随突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 320–520ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 动画只解释因果，不装饰空闲区域；选中、加载、成功和错误过渡都必须明确。\n- 提供等效键盘行为和持续可见的焦点样式，并把 prefers-reduced-motion 设计成正式静态构图。\n\n响应式转化\n- 桌面端保持非对称分栏；平板缩窄媒体列，360px 手机端按“主信息—主操作—媒体—辅助内容”重排。\n- 1440px、768px 和 360px 都不得出现横向溢出；触控目标至少 44px，并保持媒体正确宽高比。\n\n验收检查\n- 文字与控件达到 WCAG AA，保留合理源码顺序，给每个输入项添加标签，仅为承载信息的图片提供替代文本。\n- 检查所有操作、外部路径、展开区域和失败回退；完成界面不得出现裁切或运行时错误。\n- 保持数据和展示强类型，合并重复样式，并在 README 中记录配置、响应式和减少动态效果验收。"
