    "summary": "这是一个面向“404”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 layered frosted-glass surfaces、cinematic depth and lighting、controlled luminous accents，并以“purposeful hover feedback”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合将独立的 404 模块加入现有营销站、产品页或作品集。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement a space-themed not-found experience with a stranded explorer, orbital wayfinding, destination shortcuts, and a clear route home. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nPRODUCTION RULES\nStart from React 19, TypeScript, and Vite. Compose responsive styles with Tailwind CSS v4, interaction motion with motion/react, and icons with lucide-react.\nReference scope: a memorable not-found state with a clear recovery path. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nVISUAL LANGUAGE\n- Compose the page with a centered focal composition; express that structure through layered frosted-glass surfaces; cinematic depth and lighting; controlled luminous accents; subtle directional gradients.\n- Turn graphite, silver, and warm amber into named CSS design tokens; use Inter to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1440px content width, a highly structured spacing rhythm, and roughly 24px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nCONTENT ARCHITECTURE\n1. Make the failure state itself useful: stage a space-themed not-found experience with a stranded explorer, orbital wayfinding, destination shortcuts, and a clear route home, then present the recovery choices in the first keyboard tab sequence.\n2. Keep the status message, search or destination shortcuts, and primary return action visually separate so the user never reaches a dead end.\n3. Do not invent a full marketing site around the error; make one memorable screen and a compact navigation fallback.\n\nBEHAVIOR AND FEEDBACK\n- Use purposeful hover feedback, staggered entrance transitions to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 220–320ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Choreograph entry, interaction, and exit as separate states, using transforms and opacity so the interface stays responsive under load.\n- Confirm keyboard parity for hover-only discoveries and expose the same information in a stable prefers-reduced-motion presentation.\n\nRESPONSIVE STRATEGY\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nFINAL VERIFICATION\n- Apply WCAG AA to text and controls, preserve source order, label every input, and provide meaningful alternative text only where imagery carries information.\n- Test all calls to action, external routes, expandable regions, and failure fallbacks; the finished interface must produce no clipping or runtime errors.\n- Keep data and presentation typed, consolidate repeated styles, and include a README with setup plus responsive and reduced-motion verification.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现包含迷航探索者、轨道式导引、目的地捷径和明确返回入口的太空主题 404 页面。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n生产规则\n从 React 19、TypeScript 和 Vite 开始，以 Tailwind CSS v4 组织响应式样式、motion/react 处理交互动画、lucide-react 提供图标。\n参考范围：有记忆点且提供清晰恢复路径的未找到状态。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n视觉语言\n- 主体构图采用居中的视觉焦点构图；视觉语言由有层次的磨砂玻璃表面、电影感纵深与光影、克制的发光强调、细微方向性渐变构成。\n- 把 graphite, silver, and warm amber 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1440px，采用高度结构化的间距节奏，基础圆角约 24px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n内容架构\n1. 让失败状态本身有用：以包含迷航探索者、轨道式导引、目的地捷径和明确返回入口的太空主题 404 页面建立记忆点，并把恢复选项放进最先到达的键盘焦点顺序。\n2. 明确区分状态说明、搜索或目的地捷径和主返回操作，避免用户进入真正的死路。\n3. 不要围绕错误页虚构完整营销网站；只构建一个有记忆点的屏幕和精简导航回退。\n\n行为与反馈\n- 使用有明确意图的悬停反馈、错峰入场过渡突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 220–320ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 把入场、交互和退场拆成独立状态，使用 transform 与 opacity 保证负载下仍流畅。\n- 为仅悬停可见的信息提供键盘等价路径，并在 prefers-reduced-motion 中稳定展示相同内容。\n\n响应式策略\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n最终核验\n- 文字与控件达到 WCAG AA，保留合理源码顺序，给每个输入项添加标签，仅为承载信息的图片提供替代文本。\n- 检查所有操作、外部路径、展开区域和失败回退；完成界面不得出现裁切或运行时错误。\n- 保持数据和展示强类型，合并重复样式，并在 README 中记录配置、响应式和减少动态效果验收。"
