    "summary": "这是一个面向“SaaS”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 layered frosted-glass surfaces、cinematic depth and lighting、dark high-contrast palette，并以“purposeful hover feedback”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合 SaaS 类官网首屏、活动主视觉、作品集入口或产品发布页。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement an AI workforce platform showing specialist agent profiles, delegated tasks, proof messages, and a start-building call to action. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nFRONTEND FOUNDATION\nImplement with React 19, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS v4, motion/react, and lucide-react. Keep the component tree typed and frontend-only.\nReference scope: a high-impact hero section with navigation, a concise value proposition, primary and secondary actions, and a visual focal point. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nLOOK AND FEEL\n- Compose the page with a full-viewport opening composition; express that structure through layered frosted-glass surfaces; cinematic depth and lighting; dark high-contrast palette; subtle directional gradients.\n- Turn #010101, #2B2B2B, #101010 into named CSS design tokens; use Inter with Geist to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1440px content width, a highly structured spacing rhythm, and roughly 24px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nCORE SURFACES\n1. Concentrate the opening viewport on an AI workforce platform showing specialist agent profiles, delegated tasks, proof messages, and a start-building call to action, with one dominant promise, supporting explanation, primary action, secondary route, and visual proof.\n2. Expose just enough adjacent content to signal what follows; do not turn the hero into a generic feature dashboard or duplicate the same message in multiple cards.\n3. The value proposition and primary action must remain complete when decorative media and advanced motion are unavailable.\n\nINTERACTION MODEL\n- Use purposeful hover feedback, staggered entrance transitions to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 220–320ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Choreograph entry, interaction, and exit as separate states, using transforms and opacity so the interface stays responsive under load.\n- Confirm keyboard parity for hover-only discoveries and expose the same information in a stable prefers-reduced-motion presentation.\n\nLAYOUT TRANSITIONS\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nREVIEW CHECKLIST\n- Apply WCAG AA to text and controls, preserve source order, label every input, and provide meaningful alternative text only where imagery carries information.\n- Test all calls to action, external routes, expandable regions, and failure fallbacks; the finished interface must produce no clipping or runtime errors.\n- Keep data and presentation typed, consolidate repeated styles, and include a README with setup plus responsive and reduced-motion verification.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现展示专业智能体档案、已委派任务、成果消息和开始搭建入口的 AI 劳动力平台。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n前端基础\n使用 React 19、TypeScript、Vite、Tailwind CSS v4、motion/react 和 lucide-react 实现；组件树保持强类型且仅包含前端能力。\n参考范围：包含导航、精炼价值主张、主次操作和视觉焦点的高冲击首屏。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n观感定义\n- 主体构图采用占满首屏的开场构图；视觉语言由有层次的磨砂玻璃表面、电影感纵深与光影、深色高对比配色、细微方向性渐变构成。\n- 把 #010101, #2B2B2B, #101010 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter with Geist 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1440px，采用高度结构化的间距节奏，基础圆角约 24px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n核心界面\n1. 把首屏集中在展示专业智能体档案、已委派任务、成果消息和开始搭建入口的 AI 劳动力平台，包含一个主承诺、支持解释、主操作、次级路径和视觉证明。\n2. 只露出足够的后续内容提示页面走向，不要把首屏做成通用功能仪表盘，也不要在多张卡片里重复同一信息。\n3. 装饰媒体和高级动画不可用时，价值主张与主操作仍必须完整成立。\n\n交互模型\n- 使用有明确意图的悬停反馈、错峰入场过渡突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 220–320ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 把入场、交互和退场拆成独立状态，使用 transform 与 opacity 保证负载下仍流畅。\n- 为仅悬停可见的信息提供键盘等价路径，并在 prefers-reduced-motion 中稳定展示相同内容。\n\n布局转换\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n评审清单\n- 文字与控件达到 WCAG AA，保留合理源码顺序，给每个输入项添加标签，仅为承载信息的图片提供替代文本。\n- 检查所有操作、外部路径、展开区域和失败回退；完成界面不得出现裁切或运行时错误。\n- 保持数据和展示强类型，合并重复样式，并在 README 中记录配置、响应式和减少动态效果验收。"
