    "summary": "这是一个面向“Travel”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 layered frosted-glass surfaces、subtle directional gradients，并以“a restrained pointer-following effect”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合 Travel 类官网首屏、活动主视觉、作品集入口或产品发布页。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement a conversational trip planner that turns preferences into a map-linked day plan, editable stops, budget signals, and a saved itinerary. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nIMPLEMENTATION CONTRACT\nUse React 19 + TypeScript on Vite, Tailwind CSS v4 for layout tokens, motion/react for purposeful animation, and lucide-react for interface icons.\nReference scope: a high-impact hero section with navigation, a concise value proposition, primary and secondary actions, and a visual focal point. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nVISUAL READING\n- Compose the page with a centered focal composition; express that structure through layered frosted-glass surfaces; subtle directional gradients.\n- Turn #0a0a0a, #1a1a1a, #767676, #905831 into named CSS design tokens; use Inter with Geist to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1440px content width, a highly structured spacing rhythm, and roughly 24px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nEXPERIENCE BLUEPRINT\n1. Turn a conversational trip planner that turns preferences into a map-linked day plan, editable stops, budget signals, and a saved itinerary into a browsable journey with meaningful place, route, or schedule context instead of generic destination cards.\n2. Connect discovery to a saved choice or planning action, and make location, timing, price assumptions, and availability explicitly fictional.\n3. Use maps and imagery as progressive enhancement; the itinerary and primary route must remain understandable without them.\n\nMOTION CHOREOGRAPHY\n- Use a restrained pointer-following effect, purposeful hover feedback to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 220–320ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Sequence movement from the primary action outward, cancel stale transitions after rapid input, and avoid animating width, height, top, or left.\n- All controls must complete through keyboard navigation; prefers-reduced-motion removes continuous movement while retaining concise opacity feedback.\n\nRESPONSIVE TRANSFORMATION\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nACCEPTANCE CHECKS\n- Maintain WCAG AA contrast, logical heading order, accessible names for icon controls, and status messages that do not depend on color.\n- Confirm that the main task survives missing media, slow loading, long copy, repeated input, and an entirely keyboard-driven session.\n- Return a complete Vite project with shared tokens, reusable components, no unnecessary dependency, and concise operating notes.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现把偏好转成地图联动日程、可编辑站点、预算提示和已保存行程的对话式旅行规划器。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n实施约束\n采用 React 19 + TypeScript + Vite，使用 Tailwind CSS v4 管理布局令牌、motion/react 实现有意义的动画、lucide-react 提供界面图标。\n参考范围：包含导航、精炼价值主张、主次操作和视觉焦点的高冲击首屏。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n视觉解读\n- 主体构图采用居中的视觉焦点构图；视觉语言由有层次的磨砂玻璃表面、细微方向性渐变构成。\n- 把 #0a0a0a, #1a1a1a, #767676, #905831 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter with Geist 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1440px，采用高度结构化的间距节奏，基础圆角约 24px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n体验结构\n1. 把把偏好转成地图联动日程、可编辑站点、预算提示和已保存行程的对话式旅行规划器做成可浏览旅程，提供真实有用的地点、路线或日程语境，而不是通用目的地卡片。\n2. 把发现行为连接到收藏或规划操作，并明确地点、时间、价格假设和可用状态均为虚构。\n3. 地图和图片只做渐进增强；缺少媒体时，行程与主路线仍必须清楚。\n\n动画编排\n- 使用克制的指针跟随、有明确意图的悬停反馈突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 220–320ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 运动从主操作向外展开，快速连续输入时取消过时过渡，避免动画 width、height、top 或 left。\n- 所有控件都能用键盘完成；prefers-reduced-motion 移除持续运动，只保留精炼透明度反馈。\n\n响应式转化\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n验收检查\n- 保持 WCAG AA 对比度、合理标题顺序、纯图标控件的可访问名称，以及不依赖颜色的状态信息。\n- 确认主任务在媒体缺失、加载缓慢、长文案、重复输入和全键盘会话下仍可完成。\n- 返回完整 Vite 项目，使用共享令牌和可复用组件，不增加无关依赖，并提供精炼运行说明。"
