    "prompt": "Design and implement a beauty catalog navigator with skin, hair, fragrance, and body categories, editorial imagery, product counts, and tactile hover discovery. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nBUILD BASIS\nImplement with React 19, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS v4, motion/react, and lucide-react. Keep the component tree typed and frontend-only.\nReference scope: a feature presentation with clear hierarchy, concise benefits, and visual demonstrations. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nART DIRECTION\n- Compose the page with a feature presentation with clear hierarchy, concise benefits, and visual demonstrations; express that structure through subtle directional gradients.\n- Turn deep navy, cool gray, and luminous cyan into named CSS design tokens; use Inter to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1440px content width, a highly structured spacing rhythm, and roughly 24px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nINTERFACE ANATOMY\n1. Build one reusable section around a beauty catalog navigator with skin, hair, fragrance, and body categories, editorial imagery, product counts, and tactile hover discovery, with typed content props and no dependency on the surrounding page theme.\n2. Provide a complete default example, a clear section heading hierarchy, and enough outer spacing for the component to sit between unrelated sections.\n3. Keep the section focused on one job; do not expand it into a generic page, navigation shell, or invented product suite.\n\nINTERACTION RHYTHM\n- Use purposeful hover feedback, staggered entrance transitions, masked content reveals to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 220–320ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Animate transforms and opacity instead of layout-heavy properties; provide immediate hover, focus, pressed, selected, loading, success, and failure feedback where the flow needs it.\n- Keyboard users must reach the same outcomes as pointer users; under prefers-reduced-motion, remove parallax, autoplay loops, and large travel while preserving state changes.\n\nBREAKPOINT BEHAVIOR\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nDEFINITION OF DONE\n- Ensure WCAG AA contrast, semantic structure, accessible control names, visible focus, and text equivalents for any information-bearing visual.\n- Complete a release pass for navigation, forms, media fallback, long content, error recovery, and runtime console health.\n- Deliver reusable typed code, shared tokens, no speculative services, and a short README that records desktop, tablet, mobile, and reduced-motion checks.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现用护肤、护发、香氛和身体护理分类、编辑图片、商品数量和触感悬停完成探索的美妆目录导航。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n构建基础\n使用 React 19、TypeScript、Vite、Tailwind CSS v4、motion/react 和 lucide-react 实现；组件树保持强类型且仅包含前端能力。\n参考范围：层级清楚、收益精炼并带视觉演示的功能展示。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n美术方向\n- 主体构图采用层级清楚、利益点精炼且带视觉演示的功能展示；视觉语言由细微方向性渐变构成。\n- 把 deep navy, cool gray, and luminous cyan 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1440px，采用高度结构化的间距节奏，基础圆角约 24px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n界面组成\n1. 围绕用护肤、护发、香氛和身体护理分类、编辑图片、商品数量和触感悬停完成探索的美妆目录导航构建单一可复用模块，内容通过强类型属性传入，不依赖外部页面主题。\n2. 提供完整默认示例、清楚标题层级和足够外边距，使组件能嵌入互不相关的页面区块之间。\n3. 模块只完成一个任务，不要扩展成通用整页、导航框架或虚构产品套件。\n\n交互节奏\n- 使用有明确意图的悬停反馈、错峰入场过渡、遮罩式内容揭示突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 220–320ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 优先动画 transform 与 opacity，不动画高成本布局属性；按流程需要提供即时悬停、焦点、按下、选中、加载、成功和失败反馈。\n- 键盘用户必须得到与指针用户相同的结果；prefers-reduced-motion 下移除视差、自动循环和大幅位移，同时保留状态变化。\n\n断点行为\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n完成标准\n- 确保 WCAG AA 对比度、语义结构、控件可访问名称、可见焦点，以及信息型视觉的文字等价内容。\n- 完成导航、表单、媒体回退、长内容、错误恢复和控制台健康的发布检查。\n- 交付可复用强类型代码、共享令牌、不引入推测性服务，并在 README 记录桌面、平板、手机和减少动态效果检查。"
