    "summary": "这是一个面向“SaaS”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 restrained minimalist styling、quiet premium detailing、layered frosted-glass surfaces，并以“slow ambient floating motion”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合 SaaS 类官网首屏、活动主视觉、作品集入口或产品发布页。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement a business-software hero that connects a concise promise to a live dashboard preview, workflow benefits, proof points, and a product-demo action. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nTECHNICAL FRAME\nUse React 19 + TypeScript on Vite, Tailwind CSS v4 for layout tokens, motion/react for purposeful animation, and lucide-react for interface icons.\nReference scope: a high-impact hero section with navigation, a concise value proposition, primary and secondary actions, and a visual focal point. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nDESIGN SYSTEM\n- Compose the page with a full-viewport opening composition; a dense but legible dashboard shell; a centered focal composition; express that structure through restrained minimalist styling; quiet premium detailing; layered frosted-glass surfaces.\n- Turn #ededed, #d9d9d9, #ef4d23, #0b0f1a into named CSS design tokens; use Inter to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1320px content width, a compact but breathable spacing rhythm, and roughly 20px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nUSER JOURNEY\n1. Concentrate the opening viewport on a business-software hero that connects a concise promise to a live dashboard preview, workflow benefits, proof points, and a product-demo action, with one dominant promise, supporting explanation, primary action, secondary route, and visual proof.\n2. Expose just enough adjacent content to signal what follows; do not turn the hero into a generic feature dashboard or duplicate the same message in multiple cards.\n3. The value proposition and primary action must remain complete when decorative media and advanced motion are unavailable.\n\nANIMATION LOGIC\n- Use slow ambient floating motion to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 180–240ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Sequence movement from the primary action outward, cancel stale transitions after rapid input, and avoid animating width, height, top, or left.\n- All controls must complete through keyboard navigation; prefers-reduced-motion removes continuous movement while retaining concise opacity feedback.\n\nDEVICE ADAPTATION\n- Allow sidebar and multi-panel context at 1440px, merge secondary information at 768px, and reduce mobile to one primary task plus expandable support panels at 360px.\n- Tables, charts, and controls must not clip; use semantic scroll regions, compact labels, and touch targets of at least 44px where needed.\n\nQUALITY GATE\n- Use semantic elements and WCAG AA contrast, expose visible focus at every stop, and announce asynchronous state changes to assistive technology.\n- Validate the intended conversion or task path from first action to completion, including disabled, error, retry, and media-unavailable states.\n- Ship clean component boundaries, documented design tokens, a runnable build, and a compact record of device-width checks.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现把精炼承诺、实时仪表盘预览、工作流收益、证明信息和产品演示入口连起来的企业软件首屏。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n技术框架\n采用 React 19 + TypeScript + Vite，使用 Tailwind CSS v4 管理布局令牌、motion/react 实现有意义的动画、lucide-react 提供界面图标。\n参考范围：包含导航、精炼价值主张、主次操作和视觉焦点的高冲击首屏。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n设计系统\n- 主体构图采用占满首屏的开场构图、信息密集但清晰的仪表盘框架、居中的视觉焦点构图；视觉语言由克制的极简风格、安静克制的高级细节、有层次的磨砂玻璃表面构成。\n- 把 #ededed, #d9d9d9, #ef4d23, #0b0f1a 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1320px，采用紧凑但有呼吸感的间距节奏，基础圆角约 20px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n用户旅程\n1. 把首屏集中在把精炼承诺、实时仪表盘预览、工作流收益、证明信息和产品演示入口连起来的企业软件首屏，包含一个主承诺、支持解释、主操作、次级路径和视觉证明。\n2. 只露出足够的后续内容提示页面走向，不要把首屏做成通用功能仪表盘，也不要在多张卡片里重复同一信息。\n3. 装饰媒体和高级动画不可用时，价值主张与主操作仍必须完整成立。\n\n动画逻辑\n- 使用缓慢环境漂浮动画突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 180–240ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 运动从主操作向外展开，快速连续输入时取消过时过渡，避免动画 width、height、top 或 left。\n- 所有控件都能用键盘完成；prefers-reduced-motion 移除持续运动，只保留精炼透明度反馈。\n\n设备适配\n- 1440px 桌面端允许侧栏与多面板，768px 合并次级信息，360px 压缩成单一主任务和可展开辅助面板。\n- 表格、图表和控制项不得被裁切；必要时提供语义化滚动容器、紧凑标签和至少 44px 的触控目标。\n\n质量门禁\n- 使用语义元素和 WCAG AA 对比度，让每个焦点位置清楚可见，并向辅助技术播报异步状态变化。\n- 从首次操作到完成验收目标转化或任务路径，覆盖禁用、错误、重试和媒体不可用状态。\n- 交付清晰组件边界、已记录的设计令牌、可运行构建和精简设备宽度检查记录。"
