    "sourceUrl": "https://motionsites.ai/apps?prompt=cross-border",
    "previewUrl": "https://pub-86dc5b5484314368ac5436a674b0d919.r2.dev/mobile%20apps/freeautomobile.mp4",
    "previewType": "video",
    "verifiedAt": "2026-08-17",
    "summary": "这是一个面向“Transportation”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 subtle directional gradients，并以“purposeful hover feedback”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合 Transportation 类 Web 或移动应用的界面原型、产品演示与交互概念验证。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement a cross-border freight service with route visualization, shipment milestones, customs reassurance, quote inputs, and operations proof. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nBUILD BASIS\nImplement with React 19, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS v4, motion/react, and lucide-react. Keep the component tree typed and frontend-only.\nReference scope: a responsive application shell with clear navigation and task-focused content regions. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nART DIRECTION\n- Compose the page with a full-viewport opening composition; a centered focal composition; express that structure through subtle directional gradients.\n- Turn #1a1a1a, #2a2a2a, #3a3a3a, #111111 into named CSS design tokens; use a high-contrast display face paired with a neutral UI sans-serif to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1440px content width, a highly structured spacing rhythm, and roughly 24px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nINTERFACE ANATOMY\n1. Make the main workspace specifically serve a cross-border freight service with route visualization, shipment milestones, customs reassurance, quote inputs, and operations proof; avoid a generic dashboard filled with unrelated cards.\n2. Define the primary task, one supporting insight surface, and the exact empty, loading, selected, success, and error states needed for that workflow.\n3. Use a small typed local dataset only where records must be visible, label simulated information clearly, and persist nothing beyond optional device-local preferences.\n\nINTERACTION RHYTHM\n- Use purposeful hover feedback, staggered entrance transitions, masked content reveals to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 220–320ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Keep animation on composited properties, stop ambient sequences when offscreen, and never make reading wait for a reveal to finish.\n- Test the complete flow with keyboard input; when prefers-reduced-motion is active, disable looping, parallax, and depth effects without hiding content.\n\nBREAKPOINT BEHAVIOR\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nDEFINITION OF DONE\n- Ensure WCAG AA contrast, semantic structure, accessible control names, visible focus, and text equivalents for any information-bearing visual.\n- Complete a release pass for navigation, forms, media fallback, long content, error recovery, and runtime console health.\n- Deliver reusable typed code, shared tokens, no speculative services, and a short README that records desktop, tablet, mobile, and reduced-motion checks.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现包含路线可视化、运输里程碑、清关保障、报价输入和运营证明的跨境货运服务页。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n构建基础\n使用 React 19、TypeScript、Vite、Tailwind CSS v4、motion/react 和 lucide-react 实现；组件树保持强类型且仅包含前端能力。\n参考范围：带清晰导航和任务导向内容区的响应式应用框架。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n美术方向\n- 主体构图采用占满首屏的开场构图、居中的视觉焦点构图；视觉语言由细微方向性渐变构成。\n- 把 #1a1a1a, #2a2a2a, #3a3a3a, #111111 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 高对比展示字体搭配中性 UI 无衬线字体 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1440px，采用高度结构化的间距节奏，基础圆角约 24px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n界面组成\n1. 让主工作区专门服务于包含路线可视化、运输里程碑、清关保障、报价输入和运营证明的跨境货运服务页，不要用无关卡片拼成通用仪表盘。\n2. 定义核心任务、一个辅助洞察区域，以及该流程真正需要的空、加载、选中、成功和错误状态。\n3. 只有界面必须展示记录时才使用少量强类型本地数据，清楚标记模拟信息，除可选设备偏好外不做持久化。\n\n交互节奏\n- 使用有明确意图的悬停反馈、错峰入场过渡、遮罩式内容揭示突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 220–320ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 只在合成属性上运行动画，元素离开视口后停止环境效果，不得让用户等待揭示动画结束才能阅读。\n- 使用键盘完成全部流程；prefers-reduced-motion 启用时关闭循环、视差和景深，但不能隐藏内容。\n\n断点行为\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n完成标准\n- 确保 WCAG AA 对比度、语义结构、控件可访问名称、可见焦点，以及信息型视觉的文字等价内容。\n- 完成导航、表单、媒体回退、长内容、错误恢复和控制台健康的发布检查。\n- 交付可复用强类型代码、共享令牌、不引入推测性服务，并在 README 记录桌面、平板、手机和减少动态效果检查。"
