    "summary": "这是一个面向“Portfolio”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 subtle directional gradients，并以“purposeful hover feedback”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合 Portfolio 类官网首屏、活动主视觉、作品集入口或产品发布页。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement a film and digital director portfolio with a cinematic showreel, project credits, genre filters, behind-the-scenes notes, and representation contact. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nBUILD BASIS\nThe delivery stack is React 19, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS v4, motion/react, and lucide-react; avoid adding a backend or unrelated packages.\nReference scope: a high-impact hero section with navigation, a concise value proposition, primary and secondary actions, and a visual focal point. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nART DIRECTION\n- Compose the page with a full-viewport opening composition; express that structure through subtle directional gradients.\n- Turn #0B0B0B, #000000, #ffffff into named CSS design tokens; use Inter to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1240px content width, an editorially paced spacing rhythm, and roughly 16px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nINTERFACE ANATOMY\n1. Concentrate the opening viewport on a film and digital director portfolio with a cinematic showreel, project credits, genre filters, behind-the-scenes notes, and representation contact, with one dominant promise, supporting explanation, primary action, secondary route, and visual proof.\n2. Expose just enough adjacent content to signal what follows; do not turn the hero into a generic feature dashboard or duplicate the same message in multiple cards.\n3. The value proposition and primary action must remain complete when decorative media and advanced motion are unavailable.\n\nINTERACTION RHYTHM\n- Use purposeful hover feedback, staggered entrance transitions, lightweight 3D-inspired depth to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 320–520ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Use motion to connect cause and effect, not to decorate idle space; selected, loading, success, and error transitions must remain unambiguous.\n- Provide equivalent keyboard behavior and persistent focus styling, and make prefers-reduced-motion a first-class static composition rather than an afterthought.\n\nBREAKPOINT BEHAVIOR\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nDEFINITION OF DONE\n- Ensure WCAG AA contrast, semantic structure, accessible control names, visible focus, and text equivalents for any information-bearing visual.\n- Complete a release pass for navigation, forms, media fallback, long content, error recovery, and runtime console health.\n- Deliver reusable typed code, shared tokens, no speculative services, and a short README that records desktop, tablet, mobile, and reduced-motion checks.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现包含电影感作品短片、项目职员表、类型筛选、幕后说明和代理联系信息的影视数字导演作品集。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n构建基础\n固定技术栈为 React 19、TypeScript、Vite、Tailwind CSS v4、motion/react 和 lucide-react；不要增加后端或无关依赖。\n参考范围：包含导航、精炼价值主张、主次操作和视觉焦点的高冲击首屏。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n美术方向\n- 主体构图采用占满首屏的开场构图；视觉语言由细微方向性渐变构成。\n- 把 #0B0B0B, #000000, #ffffff 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1240px，采用具有编辑节奏的间距节奏，基础圆角约 16px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n界面组成\n1. 把首屏集中在包含电影感作品短片、项目职员表、类型筛选、幕后说明和代理联系信息的影视数字导演作品集，包含一个主承诺、支持解释、主操作、次级路径和视觉证明。\n2. 只露出足够的后续内容提示页面走向，不要把首屏做成通用功能仪表盘，也不要在多张卡片里重复同一信息。\n3. 装饰媒体和高级动画不可用时，价值主张与主操作仍必须完整成立。\n\n交互节奏\n- 使用有明确意图的悬停反馈、错峰入场过渡、轻量 3D 景深突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 320–520ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 动画只解释因果，不装饰空闲区域；选中、加载、成功和错误过渡都必须明确。\n- 提供等效键盘行为和持续可见的焦点样式，并把 prefers-reduced-motion 设计成正式静态构图。\n\n断点行为\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n完成标准\n- 确保 WCAG AA 对比度、语义结构、控件可访问名称、可见焦点，以及信息型视觉的文字等价内容。\n- 完成导航、表单、媒体回退、长内容、错误恢复和控制台健康的发布检查。\n- 交付可复用强类型代码、共享令牌、不引入推测性服务，并在 README 记录桌面、平板、手机和减少动态效果检查。"
