    "summary": "这是一个面向“Landing Page”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 layered frosted-glass surfaces、cinematic depth and lighting、subtle directional gradients，并以“staggered entrance transitions”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合 Landing Page 类产品发布、活动推广、获客落地页与品牌概念站。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement an experiential design studio landing page that sequences immersive case studies, capability proof, process snapshots, and a new-business conversation. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nFRONTEND FOUNDATION\nUse React 19 + TypeScript on Vite, Tailwind CSS v4 for layout tokens, motion/react for purposeful animation, and lucide-react for interface icons.\nReference scope: a complete landing page with a focused hero, trust evidence, benefits, product proof, conversion section, and footer. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nLOOK AND FEEL\n- Compose the page with a full-viewport opening composition; a centered focal composition; express that structure through layered frosted-glass surfaces; cinematic depth and lighting; subtle directional gradients.\n- Turn bone white, ink black, and restrained lime into named CSS design tokens; use Inter to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1320px content width, a compact but breathable spacing rhythm, and roughly 20px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nCORE SURFACES\n1. Build a complete narrative for an experiential design studio landing page that sequences immersive case studies, capability proof, process snapshots, and a new-business conversation: focused opening, product or service proof, mechanism, benefits, evidence, conversion, and compact footer.\n2. Give every section a different communication job and let the visual focal element evolve instead of repeating the same card grid.\n3. Use concise fictional copy and contextual evidence; omit invented enterprise logos, live counters, and claims that cannot be demonstrated in the interface.\n\nINTERACTION MODEL\n- Use staggered entrance transitions to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 180–240ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Use motion to connect cause and effect, not to decorate idle space; selected, loading, success, and error transitions must remain unambiguous.\n- Provide equivalent keyboard behavior and persistent focus styling, and make prefers-reduced-motion a first-class static composition rather than an afterthought.\n\nLAYOUT TRANSITIONS\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nREVIEW CHECKLIST\n- Reach WCAG AA while keeping labels, descriptions, heading hierarchy, and focus order understandable without the visual layout.\n- Review every interactive state with mouse, touch, and keyboard; prevent dead controls, broken assets, clipped content, horizontal overflow, and console noise.\n- Use small typed components, centralize repeated constants, and provide install, run, build, and validation notes in the README.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现依次呈现沉浸式案例、能力证明、流程片段和新业务咨询的体验设计工作室落地页。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n前端基础\n采用 React 19 + TypeScript + Vite，使用 Tailwind CSS v4 管理布局令牌、motion/react 实现有意义的动画、lucide-react 提供界面图标。\n参考范围：包含聚焦首屏、信任证据、收益、产品证明、转化区和页脚的完整落地页。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n观感定义\n- 主体构图采用占满首屏的开场构图、居中的视觉焦点构图；视觉语言由有层次的磨砂玻璃表面、电影感纵深与光影、细微方向性渐变构成。\n- 把 bone white, ink black, and restrained lime 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1320px，采用紧凑但有呼吸感的间距节奏，基础圆角约 20px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n核心界面\n1. 为依次呈现沉浸式案例、能力证明、流程片段和新业务咨询的体验设计工作室落地页构建完整叙事：聚焦开场、产品或服务证明、作用机制、收益、证据、转化和精简页脚。\n2. 让每个区块承担不同沟通任务，并让视觉焦点持续演化，不要重复同一种卡片网格。\n3. 使用精炼虚构文案和有语境的证据；省略虚构企业徽标、实时计数和界面无法证明的主张。\n\n交互模型\n- 使用错峰入场过渡突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 180–240ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 动画只解释因果，不装饰空闲区域；选中、加载、成功和错误过渡都必须明确。\n- 提供等效键盘行为和持续可见的焦点样式，并把 prefers-reduced-motion 设计成正式静态构图。\n\n布局转换\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n评审清单\n- 达到 WCAG AA，并确保脱离视觉布局后标签、说明、标题层级和焦点顺序仍能理解。\n- 使用鼠标、触摸和键盘检查全部交互状态，避免失效控件、损坏资源、内容裁切、横向溢出和控制台噪声。\n- 使用小型强类型组件、集中重复常量，并在 README 中提供安装、运行、构建和验收说明。"
