    "prompt": "Design and implement a playful brand-system explorer with color tokens, character states, typography samples, component examples, and copyable usage guidance. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nENGINEERING SCOPE\nCreate a clean React 19 + TypeScript + Vite implementation. Use Tailwind CSS v4, motion/react, and lucide-react as the only presentation essentials.\nReference scope: a high-impact hero section with navigation, a concise value proposition, primary and secondary actions, and a visual focal point. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nCOMPOSITION AND TYPE\n- Compose the page with a centered focal composition; express that structure through bright neutral canvas; subtle directional gradients; quiet premium detailing.\n- Turn #61B800, #4EC604, #FF4B4B, #FF9600 into named CSS design tokens; use Inter to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1320px content width, a compact but breathable spacing rhythm, and roughly 20px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nPAGE SEQUENCE\n1. Concentrate the opening viewport on a playful brand-system explorer with color tokens, character states, typography samples, component examples, and copyable usage guidance, with one dominant promise, supporting explanation, primary action, secondary route, and visual proof.\n2. Expose just enough adjacent content to signal what follows; do not turn the hero into a generic feature dashboard or duplicate the same message in multiple cards.\n3. The value proposition and primary action must remain complete when decorative media and advanced motion are unavailable.\n\nMOTION DIRECTION\n- Use a restrained pointer-following effect, purposeful hover feedback, lightweight 3D-inspired depth to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 180–240ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Animate transforms and opacity instead of layout-heavy properties; provide immediate hover, focus, pressed, selected, loading, success, and failure feedback where the flow needs it.\n- Keyboard users must reach the same outcomes as pointer users; under prefers-reduced-motion, remove parallax, autoplay loops, and large travel while preserving state changes.\n\nMOBILE AND DESKTOP\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nSHIP CRITERIA\n- Apply WCAG AA to text and controls, preserve source order, label every input, and provide meaningful alternative text only where imagery carries information.\n- Test all calls to action, external routes, expandable regions, and failure fallbacks; the finished interface must produce no clipping or runtime errors.\n- Keep data and presentation typed, consolidate repeated styles, and include a README with setup plus responsive and reduced-motion verification.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现包含色彩令牌、角色状态、字体样例、组件示例和可复制使用规范的趣味品牌系统浏览器。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n工程范围\n构建整洁的 React 19 + TypeScript + Vite 实现，展示层只使用 Tailwind CSS v4、motion/react 和 lucide-react。\n参考范围：包含导航、精炼价值主张、主次操作和视觉焦点的高冲击首屏。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n构图与字体\n- 主体构图采用居中的视觉焦点构图；视觉语言由明亮中性画布、细微方向性渐变、安静克制的高级细节构成。\n- 把 #61B800, #4EC604, #FF4B4B, #FF9600 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1320px，采用紧凑但有呼吸感的间距节奏，基础圆角约 20px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n页面序列\n1. 把首屏集中在包含色彩令牌、角色状态、字体样例、组件示例和可复制使用规范的趣味品牌系统浏览器，包含一个主承诺、支持解释、主操作、次级路径和视觉证明。\n2. 只露出足够的后续内容提示页面走向，不要把首屏做成通用功能仪表盘，也不要在多张卡片里重复同一信息。\n3. 装饰媒体和高级动画不可用时，价值主张与主操作仍必须完整成立。\n\n动态方向\n- 使用克制的指针跟随、有明确意图的悬停反馈、轻量 3D 景深突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 180–240ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 优先动画 transform 与 opacity，不动画高成本布局属性；按流程需要提供即时悬停、焦点、按下、选中、加载、成功和失败反馈。\n- 键盘用户必须得到与指针用户相同的结果；prefers-reduced-motion 下移除视差、自动循环和大幅位移，同时保留状态变化。\n\n手机与桌面\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n交付条件\n- 文字与控件达到 WCAG AA，保留合理源码顺序，给每个输入项添加标签，仅为承载信息的图片提供替代文本。\n- 检查所有操作、外部路径、展开区域和失败回退；完成界面不得出现裁切或运行时错误。\n- 保持数据和展示强类型，合并重复样式，并在 README 中记录配置、响应式和减少动态效果验收。"
