    "previewUrl": "https://pub-86dc5b5484314368ac5436a674b0d919.r2.dev/hero%20sections/halo-usd-hero-CtMXOklk.gif",
    "previewType": "image",
    "verifiedAt": "2026-08-17",
    "summary": "这是一个面向“Landing Page”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 quiet premium detailing，并以“a continuously looping marquee”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合 Landing Page 类产品发布、活动推广、获客落地页与品牌概念站。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement a digital-dollar landing page with balance and transfer preview, reserve explanation, cross-border use cases, fee clarity, and onboarding. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nPRODUCTION RULES\nShip this as a React 19 + TypeScript application running on Vite, with Tailwind CSS v4 design tokens, motion/react transitions, and lucide-react controls.\nReference scope: a complete landing page with a focused hero, trust evidence, benefits, product proof, conversion section, and footer. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nVISUAL LANGUAGE\n- Compose the page with a full-viewport opening composition; a disciplined card grid; express that structure through quiet premium detailing.\n- Turn #F5F5F5, #2B2644 into named CSS design tokens; use Inter to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1440px content width, a highly structured spacing rhythm, and roughly 24px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nCONTENT ARCHITECTURE\n1. Build a complete narrative for a digital-dollar landing page with balance and transfer preview, reserve explanation, cross-border use cases, fee clarity, and onboarding: focused opening, product or service proof, mechanism, benefits, evidence, conversion, and compact footer.\n2. Give every section a different communication job and let the visual focal element evolve instead of repeating the same card grid.\n3. Use concise fictional copy and contextual evidence; omit invented enterprise logos, live counters, and claims that cannot be demonstrated in the interface.\n\nBEHAVIOR AND FEEDBACK\n- Use a continuously looping marquee, purposeful hover feedback to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 220–320ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Keep animation on composited properties, stop ambient sequences when offscreen, and never make reading wait for a reveal to finish.\n- Test the complete flow with keyboard input; when prefers-reduced-motion is active, disable looping, parallax, and depth effects without hiding content.\n\nRESPONSIVE STRATEGY\n- Show the full grid rhythm at 1440px, reduce columns at 768px, and reorganize the interface into one deliberate reading column at 360px.\n- Do not communicate relationships through placement alone; DOM, keyboard, and screen-reader order must agree, with 44px minimum touch targets.\n\nFINAL VERIFICATION\n- Meet WCAG AA with semantic landmarks, correctly associated labels, visible focus, and alternatives for meaningful media.\n- Exercise primary, empty, loading, success, and failure paths; remove broken links, clipped text, page-level overflow, and console errors.\n- Keep component boundaries typed, document install and run steps, and state which 360px, 768px, and 1440px checks were completed.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现包含余额与转账预览、储备说明、跨境用例、费用透明度和接入流程的数字美元落地页。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n生产规则\n以 React 19 + TypeScript 应用交付，运行于 Vite，使用 Tailwind CSS v4 设计令牌、motion/react 过渡和 lucide-react 控件。\n参考范围：包含聚焦首屏、信任证据、收益、产品证明、转化区和页脚的完整落地页。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n视觉语言\n- 主体构图采用占满首屏的开场构图、秩序严谨的卡片网格；视觉语言由安静克制的高级细节构成。\n- 把 #F5F5F5, #2B2644 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1440px，采用高度结构化的间距节奏，基础圆角约 24px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n内容架构\n1. 为包含余额与转账预览、储备说明、跨境用例、费用透明度和接入流程的数字美元落地页构建完整叙事：聚焦开场、产品或服务证明、作用机制、收益、证据、转化和精简页脚。\n2. 让每个区块承担不同沟通任务，并让视觉焦点持续演化，不要重复同一种卡片网格。\n3. 使用精炼虚构文案和有语境的证据；省略虚构企业徽标、实时计数和界面无法证明的主张。\n\n行为与反馈\n- 使用连续循环跑马灯、有明确意图的悬停反馈突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 220–320ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 只在合成属性上运行动画，元素离开视口后停止环境效果，不得让用户等待揭示动画结束才能阅读。\n- 使用键盘完成全部流程；prefers-reduced-motion 启用时关闭循环、视差和景深，但不能隐藏内容。\n\n响应式策略\n- 在 1440px 展示完整网格节奏，768px 减少列数，360px 重组为单列并保留明确浏览顺序。\n- 不要仅靠视觉位置表达关系；DOM 顺序、键盘顺序和屏幕阅读器顺序必须一致，触控目标至少 44px。\n\n最终核验\n- 通过语义地标、正确关联的标签、可见焦点和有意义媒体的替代信息达到 WCAG AA。\n- 覆盖主流程、空、加载、成功和失败路径，消除失效链接、文字裁切、页面横向溢出和控制台错误。\n- 保持组件边界强类型，记录安装与运行步骤，并注明完成的 360px、768px 和 1440px 检查。"
