    "summary": "这是一个面向“Agency”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 layered frosted-glass surfaces、editorial art direction、cinematic depth and lighting，并以“scroll-linked progression”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合 Agency 类官网首屏、活动主视觉、作品集入口或产品发布页。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement an operations consultancy page that links process diagnostics, automation opportunities, delivery phases, proof metrics, and an assessment request. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nBUILD BASIS\nCreate a clean React 19 + TypeScript + Vite implementation. Use Tailwind CSS v4, motion/react, and lucide-react as the only presentation essentials.\nReference scope: a high-impact hero section with navigation, a concise value proposition, primary and secondary actions, and a visual focal point. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nART DIRECTION\n- Compose the page with a full-viewport opening composition; a disciplined card grid; express that structure through layered frosted-glass surfaces; editorial art direction; cinematic depth and lighting; controlled luminous accents.\n- Turn #0a0a0a into named CSS design tokens; use Inter to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1320px content width, a compact but breathable spacing rhythm, and roughly 20px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nINTERFACE ANATOMY\n1. Concentrate the opening viewport on an operations consultancy page that links process diagnostics, automation opportunities, delivery phases, proof metrics, and an assessment request, with one dominant promise, supporting explanation, primary action, secondary route, and visual proof.\n2. Expose just enough adjacent content to signal what follows; do not turn the hero into a generic feature dashboard or duplicate the same message in multiple cards.\n3. The value proposition and primary action must remain complete when decorative media and advanced motion are unavailable.\n\nINTERACTION RHYTHM\n- Use scroll-linked progression, purposeful hover feedback, staggered entrance transitions to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 180–240ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Keep animation on composited properties, stop ambient sequences when offscreen, and never make reading wait for a reveal to finish.\n- Test the complete flow with keyboard input; when prefers-reduced-motion is active, disable looping, parallax, and depth effects without hiding content.\n\nBREAKPOINT BEHAVIOR\n- Show the full grid rhythm at 1440px, reduce columns at 768px, and reorganize the interface into one deliberate reading column at 360px.\n- Do not communicate relationships through placement alone; DOM, keyboard, and screen-reader order must agree, with 44px minimum touch targets.\n\nDEFINITION OF DONE\n- Apply WCAG AA to text and controls, preserve source order, label every input, and provide meaningful alternative text only where imagery carries information.\n- Test all calls to action, external routes, expandable regions, and failure fallbacks; the finished interface must produce no clipping or runtime errors.\n- Keep data and presentation typed, consolidate repeated styles, and include a README with setup plus responsive and reduced-motion verification.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现把流程诊断、自动化机会、交付阶段、证明指标和评估申请连接起来的智能运营咨询页。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n构建基础\n构建整洁的 React 19 + TypeScript + Vite 实现，展示层只使用 Tailwind CSS v4、motion/react 和 lucide-react。\n参考范围：包含导航、精炼价值主张、主次操作和视觉焦点的高冲击首屏。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n美术方向\n- 主体构图采用占满首屏的开场构图、秩序严谨的卡片网格；视觉语言由有层次的磨砂玻璃表面、编辑式视觉指导、电影感纵深与光影、克制的发光强调构成。\n- 把 #0a0a0a 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1320px，采用紧凑但有呼吸感的间距节奏，基础圆角约 20px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n界面组成\n1. 把首屏集中在把流程诊断、自动化机会、交付阶段、证明指标和评估申请连接起来的智能运营咨询页，包含一个主承诺、支持解释、主操作、次级路径和视觉证明。\n2. 只露出足够的后续内容提示页面走向，不要把首屏做成通用功能仪表盘，也不要在多张卡片里重复同一信息。\n3. 装饰媒体和高级动画不可用时，价值主张与主操作仍必须完整成立。\n\n交互节奏\n- 使用与滚动进度联动的动画、有明确意图的悬停反馈、错峰入场过渡突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 180–240ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 只在合成属性上运行动画，元素离开视口后停止环境效果，不得让用户等待揭示动画结束才能阅读。\n- 使用键盘完成全部流程；prefers-reduced-motion 启用时关闭循环、视差和景深，但不能隐藏内容。\n\n断点行为\n- 在 1440px 展示完整网格节奏，768px 减少列数，360px 重组为单列并保留明确浏览顺序。\n- 不要仅靠视觉位置表达关系；DOM 顺序、键盘顺序和屏幕阅读器顺序必须一致，触控目标至少 44px。\n\n完成标准\n- 文字与控件达到 WCAG AA，保留合理源码顺序，给每个输入项添加标签，仅为承载信息的图片提供替代文本。\n- 检查所有操作、外部路径、展开区域和失败回退；完成界面不得出现裁切或运行时错误。\n- 保持数据和展示强类型，合并重复样式，并在 README 中记录配置、响应式和减少动态效果验收。"
