    "verifiedAt": "2026-08-17",
    "summary": "这是一个面向“Hero”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 controlled luminous accents、subtle directional gradients、organic forms and natural rhythm，并以“a restrained pointer-following effect”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合 Hero 类官网首屏、活动主视觉、作品集入口或产品发布页。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement an exploratory product story that asks a short preference question, changes the visual scene, reveals a tailored path, and records progress. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nBUILD BASIS\nBuild a runnable Vite frontend with React 19 and TypeScript; style it in Tailwind CSS v4, animate it with motion/react, and source functional icons from lucide-react.\nReference scope: a high-impact hero section with navigation, a concise value proposition, primary and secondary actions, and a visual focal point. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nART DIRECTION\n- Compose the page with a full-viewport opening composition; express that structure through controlled luminous accents; subtle directional gradients; organic forms and natural rhythm; quiet premium detailing.\n- Turn #e8702a, #d2611f, #ffffff into named CSS design tokens; use Inter with Playfair Display to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1440px content width, a highly structured spacing rhythm, and roughly 24px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nINTERFACE ANATOMY\n1. Concentrate the opening viewport on an exploratory product story that asks a short preference question, changes the visual scene, reveals a tailored path, and records progress, with one dominant promise, supporting explanation, primary action, secondary route, and visual proof.\n2. Expose just enough adjacent content to signal what follows; do not turn the hero into a generic feature dashboard or duplicate the same message in multiple cards.\n3. The value proposition and primary action must remain complete when decorative media and advanced motion are unavailable.\n\nINTERACTION RHYTHM\n- Use a restrained pointer-following effect, purposeful hover feedback, staggered entrance transitions to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 220–320ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Choreograph entry, interaction, and exit as separate states, using transforms and opacity so the interface stays responsive under load.\n- Confirm keyboard parity for hover-only discoveries and expose the same information in a stable prefers-reduced-motion presentation.\n\nBREAKPOINT BEHAVIOR\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nDEFINITION OF DONE\n- Use semantic elements and WCAG AA contrast, expose visible focus at every stop, and announce asynchronous state changes to assistive technology.\n- Validate the intended conversion or task path from first action to completion, including disabled, error, retry, and media-unavailable states.\n- Ship clean component boundaries, documented design tokens, a runnable build, and a compact record of device-width checks.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现通过简短偏好问题改变视觉场景、揭示定制路径并记录进度的探索式产品故事。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n构建基础\n交付可运行的 React 19 与 TypeScript Vite 前端；使用 Tailwind CSS v4 编写样式、motion/react 编排动画、lucide-react 提供功能图标。\n参考范围：包含导航、精炼价值主张、主次操作和视觉焦点的高冲击首屏。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n美术方向\n- 主体构图采用占满首屏的开场构图；视觉语言由克制的发光强调、细微方向性渐变、有机形态与自然节奏、安静克制的高级细节构成。\n- 把 #e8702a, #d2611f, #ffffff 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter with Playfair Display 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1440px，采用高度结构化的间距节奏，基础圆角约 24px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n界面组成\n1. 把首屏集中在通过简短偏好问题改变视觉场景、揭示定制路径并记录进度的探索式产品故事，包含一个主承诺、支持解释、主操作、次级路径和视觉证明。\n2. 只露出足够的后续内容提示页面走向，不要把首屏做成通用功能仪表盘，也不要在多张卡片里重复同一信息。\n3. 装饰媒体和高级动画不可用时，价值主张与主操作仍必须完整成立。\n\n交互节奏\n- 使用克制的指针跟随、有明确意图的悬停反馈、错峰入场过渡突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 220–320ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 把入场、交互和退场拆成独立状态，使用 transform 与 opacity 保证负载下仍流畅。\n- 为仅悬停可见的信息提供键盘等价路径，并在 prefers-reduced-motion 中稳定展示相同内容。\n\n断点行为\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n完成标准\n- 使用语义元素和 WCAG AA 对比度，让每个焦点位置清楚可见，并向辅助技术播报异步状态变化。\n- 从首次操作到完成验收目标转化或任务路径，覆盖禁用、错误、重试和媒体不可用状态。\n- 交付清晰组件边界、已记录的设计令牌、可运行构建和精简设备宽度检查记录。"
