    "summary": "这是一个面向“Footer Section”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 layered frosted-glass surfaces、subtle directional gradients、quiet premium detailing，并以“purposeful hover feedback”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合将独立的 Footer Section 模块加入现有营销站、产品页或作品集。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement a light-led minimal footer with a calm sign-off, newsletter field, essential navigation, legal utilities, and a restrained social row. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nRUNTIME BOUNDARY\nShip this as a React 19 + TypeScript application running on Vite, with Tailwind CSS v4 design tokens, motion/react transitions, and lucide-react controls.\nReference scope: a structured footer with brand summary, grouped navigation, utility links, and a concise closing action. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nART-DIRECTION NOTES\n- Compose the page with a structured footer with brand summary, grouped navigation, utility links, and a concise closing action; express that structure through layered frosted-glass surfaces; subtle directional gradients; quiet premium detailing.\n- Turn bone white, ink black, and restrained lime into named CSS design tokens; use Inter to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1320px content width, a compact but breathable spacing rhythm, and roughly 20px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nINFORMATION FLOW\n1. Build one reusable section around a light-led minimal footer with a calm sign-off, newsletter field, essential navigation, legal utilities, and a restrained social row, with typed content props and no dependency on the surrounding page theme.\n2. Provide a complete default example, a clear section heading hierarchy, and enough outer spacing for the component to sit between unrelated sections.\n3. Keep the section focused on one job; do not expand it into a generic page, navigation shell, or invented product suite.\n\nMICROINTERACTIONS\n- Use purposeful hover feedback to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 180–240ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Sequence movement from the primary action outward, cancel stale transitions after rapid input, and avoid animating width, height, top, or left.\n- All controls must complete through keyboard navigation; prefers-reduced-motion removes continuous movement while retaining concise opacity feedback.\n\nSCREEN-SIZE RULES\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nRELEASE STANDARD\n- Maintain WCAG AA contrast, logical heading order, accessible names for icon controls, and status messages that do not depend on color.\n- Confirm that the main task survives missing media, slow loading, long copy, repeated input, and an entirely keyboard-driven session.\n- Return a complete Vite project with shared tokens, reusable components, no unnecessary dependency, and concise operating notes.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现包含平静落款、订阅字段、必要导航、法律工具和克制社交链接的光感极简页脚。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n运行边界\n以 React 19 + TypeScript 应用交付，运行于 Vite，使用 Tailwind CSS v4 设计令牌、motion/react 过渡和 lucide-react 控件。\n参考范围：包含品牌摘要、分组导航、实用链接和收束操作的结构化页脚。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n艺术指导说明\n- 主体构图采用包含品牌摘要、分组导航、实用链接和收束操作的结构化页脚；视觉语言由有层次的磨砂玻璃表面、细微方向性渐变、安静克制的高级细节构成。\n- 把 bone white, ink black, and restrained lime 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1320px，采用紧凑但有呼吸感的间距节奏，基础圆角约 20px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n信息流\n1. 围绕包含平静落款、订阅字段、必要导航、法律工具和克制社交链接的光感极简页脚构建单一可复用模块，内容通过强类型属性传入，不依赖外部页面主题。\n2. 提供完整默认示例、清楚标题层级和足够外边距，使组件能嵌入互不相关的页面区块之间。\n3. 模块只完成一个任务，不要扩展成通用整页、导航框架或虚构产品套件。\n\n微交互\n- 使用有明确意图的悬停反馈突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 180–240ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 运动从主操作向外展开，快速连续输入时取消过时过渡，避免动画 width、height、top 或 left。\n- 所有控件都能用键盘完成；prefers-reduced-motion 移除持续运动，只保留精炼透明度反馈。\n\n屏幕尺寸规则\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n发布标准\n- 保持 WCAG AA 对比度、合理标题顺序、纯图标控件的可访问名称，以及不依赖颜色的状态信息。\n- 确认主任务在媒体缺失、加载缓慢、长文案、重复输入和全键盘会话下仍可完成。\n- 返回完整 Vite 项目，使用共享令牌和可复用组件，不增加无关依赖，并提供精炼运行说明。"
