    "summary": "这是一个面向“Medicine”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 layered frosted-glass surfaces、subtle directional gradients，并以“purposeful hover feedback”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合 Medicine 类官网首屏、活动主视觉、作品集入口或产品发布页。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement a therapeutic practice page with treatment pathways, practitioner introduction, session expectations, grounded testimonials, and booking choices. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nBUILD BASIS\nStart from React 19, TypeScript, and Vite. Compose responsive styles with Tailwind CSS v4, interaction motion with motion/react, and icons with lucide-react.\nReference scope: a high-impact hero section with navigation, a concise value proposition, primary and secondary actions, and a visual focal point. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nART DIRECTION\n- Compose the page with a full-viewport opening composition; a centered focal composition; express that structure through layered frosted-glass surfaces; subtle directional gradients.\n- Turn soft ivory, charcoal, and muted coral into named CSS design tokens; use Inter to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1320px content width, a compact but breathable spacing rhythm, and roughly 20px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nINTERFACE ANATOMY\n1. Organize a therapeutic practice page with treatment pathways, practitioner introduction, session expectations, grounded testimonials, and booking choices around reassurance, informed choice, and one calm next step rather than aggressive conversion.\n2. Distinguish educational content, practitioner or device evidence, program options, and support resources with plain-language headings.\n3. Use fictional wellness claims, avoid diagnosis or guaranteed outcomes, and expose safety or escalation guidance where the interface suggests care decisions.\n\nINTERACTION RHYTHM\n- Use purposeful hover feedback to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 180–240ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Sequence movement from the primary action outward, cancel stale transitions after rapid input, and avoid animating width, height, top, or left.\n- All controls must complete through keyboard navigation; prefers-reduced-motion removes continuous movement while retaining concise opacity feedback.\n\nBREAKPOINT BEHAVIOR\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nDEFINITION OF DONE\n- Use semantic elements and WCAG AA contrast, expose visible focus at every stop, and announce asynchronous state changes to assistive technology.\n- Validate the intended conversion or task path from first action to completion, including disabled, error, retry, and media-unavailable states.\n- Ship clean component boundaries, documented design tokens, a runnable build, and a compact record of device-width checks.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现包含治疗路径、从业者介绍、疗程预期、可信评价和预约选择的身心疗愈实践页。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n构建基础\n从 React 19、TypeScript 和 Vite 开始，以 Tailwind CSS v4 组织响应式样式、motion/react 处理交互动画、lucide-react 提供图标。\n参考范围：包含导航、精炼价值主张、主次操作和视觉焦点的高冲击首屏。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n美术方向\n- 主体构图采用占满首屏的开场构图、居中的视觉焦点构图；视觉语言由有层次的磨砂玻璃表面、细微方向性渐变构成。\n- 把 soft ivory, charcoal, and muted coral 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1320px，采用紧凑但有呼吸感的间距节奏，基础圆角约 20px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n界面组成\n1. 围绕放心、知情选择和一个平静下一步组织包含治疗路径、从业者介绍、疗程预期、可信评价和预约选择的身心疗愈实践页，避免强迫式转化。\n2. 用直白标题区分科普内容、从业者或设备证据、项目选项和支持资源。\n3. 所有健康主张必须为虚构，不做诊断或保证结果；涉及照护决策时提供安全或升级指导。\n\n交互节奏\n- 使用有明确意图的悬停反馈突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 180–240ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 运动从主操作向外展开，快速连续输入时取消过时过渡，避免动画 width、height、top 或 left。\n- 所有控件都能用键盘完成；prefers-reduced-motion 移除持续运动，只保留精炼透明度反馈。\n\n断点行为\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n完成标准\n- 使用语义元素和 WCAG AA 对比度，让每个焦点位置清楚可见，并向辅助技术播报异步状态变化。\n- 从首次操作到完成验收目标转化或任务路径，覆盖禁用、错误、重试和媒体不可用状态。\n- 交付清晰组件边界、已记录的设计令牌、可运行构建和精简设备宽度检查记录。"
