    "summary": "这是一个面向“Landing Page”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 cinematic depth and lighting、dark high-contrast palette、controlled luminous accents，并以“a restrained pointer-following effect”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合 Landing Page 类产品发布、活动推广、获客落地页与品牌概念站。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement a neon developer-tool landing page with a code-led promise, terminal demonstration, capability sequence, performance proof, and install action. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nBUILD BASIS\nCreate a clean React 19 + TypeScript + Vite implementation. Use Tailwind CSS v4, motion/react, and lucide-react as the only presentation essentials.\nReference scope: a complete landing page with a focused hero, trust evidence, benefits, product proof, conversion section, and footer. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nART DIRECTION\n- Compose the page with an asymmetric split layout; a full-viewport opening composition; a centered focal composition; express that structure through cinematic depth and lighting; dark high-contrast palette; controlled luminous accents; subtle directional gradients.\n- Turn #ffffff, #8E7F94, #e2e2e6, #010103 into named CSS design tokens; use Inter to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1240px content width, an editorially paced spacing rhythm, and roughly 16px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nINTERFACE ANATOMY\n1. Build a complete narrative for a neon developer-tool landing page with a code-led promise, terminal demonstration, capability sequence, performance proof, and install action: focused opening, product or service proof, mechanism, benefits, evidence, conversion, and compact footer.\n2. Give every section a different communication job and let the visual focal element evolve instead of repeating the same card grid.\n3. Use concise fictional copy and contextual evidence; omit invented enterprise logos, live counters, and claims that cannot be demonstrated in the interface.\n\nINTERACTION RHYTHM\n- Use a restrained pointer-following effect, purposeful hover feedback, staggered entrance transitions to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 320–520ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Limit simultaneous animation layers, pause media outside the viewport, and reserve emphasis motion for the element that changed state.\n- Maintain logical keyboard order and visible focus through every transition; prefers-reduced-motion should produce an equally legible non-animated path.\n\nBREAKPOINT BEHAVIOR\n- Preserve the asymmetric split on desktop; narrow the media column at tablet width, then reorder mobile as message, primary action, media, supporting content.\n- At 1440px, 768px, and 360px there must be no horizontal overflow; touch targets stay at least 44px and media keeps its intended aspect ratio.\n\nDEFINITION OF DONE\n- Use semantic elements and WCAG AA contrast, expose visible focus at every stop, and announce asynchronous state changes to assistive technology.\n- Validate the intended conversion or task path from first action to completion, including disabled, error, retry, and media-unavailable states.\n- Ship clean component boundaries, documented design tokens, a runnable build, and a compact record of device-width checks.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现包含代码主导承诺、终端演示、能力序列、性能证明和安装操作的霓虹开发工具落地页。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n构建基础\n构建整洁的 React 19 + TypeScript + Vite 实现，展示层只使用 Tailwind CSS v4、motion/react 和 lucide-react。\n参考范围：包含聚焦首屏、信任证据、收益、产品证明、转化区和页脚的完整落地页。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n美术方向\n- 主体构图采用非对称分栏布局、占满首屏的开场构图、居中的视觉焦点构图；视觉语言由电影感纵深与光影、深色高对比配色、克制的发光强调、细微方向性渐变构成。\n- 把 #ffffff, #8E7F94, #e2e2e6, #010103 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1240px，采用具有编辑节奏的间距节奏，基础圆角约 16px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n界面组成\n1. 为包含代码主导承诺、终端演示、能力序列、性能证明和安装操作的霓虹开发工具落地页构建完整叙事：聚焦开场、产品或服务证明、作用机制、收益、证据、转化和精简页脚。\n2. 让每个区块承担不同沟通任务，并让视觉焦点持续演化，不要重复同一种卡片网格。\n3. 使用精炼虚构文案和有语境的证据；省略虚构企业徽标、实时计数和界面无法证明的主张。\n\n交互节奏\n- 使用克制的指针跟随、有明确意图的悬停反馈、错峰入场过渡突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 320–520ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 限制同时运行动画的层数，暂停视口外媒体，只让发生状态变化的元素获得强调。\n- 所有过渡保持合理键盘顺序和可见焦点；prefers-reduced-motion 提供同样清晰的无动画路径。\n\n断点行为\n- 桌面端保持非对称分栏；平板缩窄媒体列，360px 手机端按“主信息—主操作—媒体—辅助内容”重排。\n- 1440px、768px 和 360px 都不得出现横向溢出；触控目标至少 44px，并保持媒体正确宽高比。\n\n完成标准\n- 使用语义元素和 WCAG AA 对比度，让每个焦点位置清楚可见，并向辅助技术播报异步状态变化。\n- 从首次操作到完成验收目标转化或任务路径，覆盖禁用、错误、重试和媒体不可用状态。\n- 交付清晰组件边界、已记录的设计令牌、可运行构建和精简设备宽度检查记录。"
