    "summary": "这是一个面向“Features”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 subtle directional gradients，并以“purposeful hover feedback”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合将独立的 Features 模块加入现有营销站、产品页或作品集。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement an operations-control feature with command center preview, permission-aware actions, automation toggles, incident states, and audit trace. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nIMPLEMENTATION CONTRACT\nShip this as a React 19 + TypeScript application running on Vite, with Tailwind CSS v4 design tokens, motion/react transitions, and lucide-react controls.\nReference scope: a feature presentation with clear hierarchy, concise benefits, and visual demonstrations. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nVISUAL READING\n- Compose the page with a centered focal composition; express that structure through subtle directional gradients.\n- Turn #ffffff into named CSS design tokens; use a high-contrast display face paired with a neutral UI sans-serif to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1440px content width, a highly structured spacing rhythm, and roughly 24px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nEXPERIENCE BLUEPRINT\n1. Build one reusable section around an operations-control feature with command center preview, permission-aware actions, automation toggles, incident states, and audit trace, with typed content props and no dependency on the surrounding page theme.\n2. Provide a complete default example, a clear section heading hierarchy, and enough outer spacing for the component to sit between unrelated sections.\n3. Keep the section focused on one job; do not expand it into a generic page, navigation shell, or invented product suite.\n\nMOTION CHOREOGRAPHY\n- Use purposeful hover feedback to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 220–320ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Keep animation on composited properties, stop ambient sequences when offscreen, and never make reading wait for a reveal to finish.\n- Test the complete flow with keyboard input; when prefers-reduced-motion is active, disable looping, parallax, and depth effects without hiding content.\n\nRESPONSIVE TRANSFORMATION\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nACCEPTANCE CHECKS\n- Use semantic HTML, visible focus, accurate labels, and descriptive alternatives; text and controls must meet WCAG AA and no state may rely on color alone.\n- Verify the core flow: every button and link works, media failure has a fallback, long content never clips, and the console stays error-free.\n- Reuse typed components and design tokens instead of duplicating layout code; deliver a runnable project, a short README, and recorded breakpoint checks.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现包含指挥中心预览、权限感知操作、自动化开关、事件状态和审计轨迹的运营控制功能。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n实施约束\n以 React 19 + TypeScript 应用交付，运行于 Vite，使用 Tailwind CSS v4 设计令牌、motion/react 过渡和 lucide-react 控件。\n参考范围：层级清楚、收益精炼并带视觉演示的功能展示。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n视觉解读\n- 主体构图采用居中的视觉焦点构图；视觉语言由细微方向性渐变构成。\n- 把 #ffffff 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 高对比展示字体搭配中性 UI 无衬线字体 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1440px，采用高度结构化的间距节奏，基础圆角约 24px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n体验结构\n1. 围绕包含指挥中心预览、权限感知操作、自动化开关、事件状态和审计轨迹的运营控制功能构建单一可复用模块，内容通过强类型属性传入，不依赖外部页面主题。\n2. 提供完整默认示例、清楚标题层级和足够外边距，使组件能嵌入互不相关的页面区块之间。\n3. 模块只完成一个任务，不要扩展成通用整页、导航框架或虚构产品套件。\n\n动画编排\n- 使用有明确意图的悬停反馈突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 220–320ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 只在合成属性上运行动画，元素离开视口后停止环境效果，不得让用户等待揭示动画结束才能阅读。\n- 使用键盘完成全部流程；prefers-reduced-motion 启用时关闭循环、视差和景深，但不能隐藏内容。\n\n响应式转化\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n验收检查\n- 使用语义化 HTML、可见焦点、准确标签和描述性替代文本；文字与控件达到 WCAG AA，状态不能只依赖颜色。\n- 验收核心流程：所有按钮和链接可用，媒体失败有回退，长内容不裁切，控制台无错误。\n- 复用强类型组件与设计令牌，避免重复布局代码；交付可运行项目、简短 README 和断点检查记录。"
