    "summary": "这是一个面向“Features”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 subtle directional gradients，并以“purposeful hover feedback”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合将独立的 Features 模块加入现有营销站、产品页或作品集。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement a results section that connects before-and-after operational metrics, a concise case timeline, attributed evidence, and the next optimization step. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nBUILD BASIS\nBuild a runnable Vite frontend with React 19 and TypeScript; style it in Tailwind CSS v4, animate it with motion/react, and source functional icons from lucide-react.\nReference scope: a feature presentation with clear hierarchy, concise benefits, and visual demonstrations. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nART DIRECTION\n- Compose the page with a feature presentation with clear hierarchy, concise benefits, and visual demonstrations; express that structure through subtle directional gradients.\n- Turn #c86fff into named CSS design tokens; use a clean humanist sans-serif with tabular numerals to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1320px content width, a compact but breathable spacing rhythm, and roughly 20px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nINTERFACE ANATOMY\n1. Build one reusable section around a results section that connects before-and-after operational metrics, a concise case timeline, attributed evidence, and the next optimization step, with typed content props and no dependency on the surrounding page theme.\n2. Provide a complete default example, a clear section heading hierarchy, and enough outer spacing for the component to sit between unrelated sections.\n3. Keep the section focused on one job; do not expand it into a generic page, navigation shell, or invented product suite.\n\nINTERACTION RHYTHM\n- Use purposeful hover feedback, lightweight 3D-inspired depth to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 180–240ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Sequence movement from the primary action outward, cancel stale transitions after rapid input, and avoid animating width, height, top, or left.\n- All controls must complete through keyboard navigation; prefers-reduced-motion removes continuous movement while retaining concise opacity feedback.\n\nBREAKPOINT BEHAVIOR\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nDEFINITION OF DONE\n- Use semantic elements and WCAG AA contrast, expose visible focus at every stop, and announce asynchronous state changes to assistive technology.\n- Validate the intended conversion or task path from first action to completion, including disabled, error, retry, and media-unavailable states.\n- Ship clean component boundaries, documented design tokens, a runnable build, and a compact record of device-width checks.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现把运营前后指标、精简案例时间线、具名证据和下一优化步骤连接起来的结果模块。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n构建基础\n交付可运行的 React 19 与 TypeScript Vite 前端；使用 Tailwind CSS v4 编写样式、motion/react 编排动画、lucide-react 提供功能图标。\n参考范围：层级清楚、收益精炼并带视觉演示的功能展示。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n美术方向\n- 主体构图采用层级清楚、利益点精炼且带视觉演示的功能展示；视觉语言由细微方向性渐变构成。\n- 把 #c86fff 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 带等宽数字的人文无衬线字体 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1320px，采用紧凑但有呼吸感的间距节奏，基础圆角约 20px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n界面组成\n1. 围绕把运营前后指标、精简案例时间线、具名证据和下一优化步骤连接起来的结果模块构建单一可复用模块，内容通过强类型属性传入，不依赖外部页面主题。\n2. 提供完整默认示例、清楚标题层级和足够外边距，使组件能嵌入互不相关的页面区块之间。\n3. 模块只完成一个任务，不要扩展成通用整页、导航框架或虚构产品套件。\n\n交互节奏\n- 使用有明确意图的悬停反馈、轻量 3D 景深突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 180–240ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 运动从主操作向外展开，快速连续输入时取消过时过渡，避免动画 width、height、top 或 left。\n- 所有控件都能用键盘完成；prefers-reduced-motion 移除持续运动，只保留精炼透明度反馈。\n\n断点行为\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n完成标准\n- 使用语义元素和 WCAG AA 对比度，让每个焦点位置清楚可见，并向辅助技术播报异步状态变化。\n- 从首次操作到完成验收目标转化或任务路径，覆盖禁用、错误、重试和媒体不可用状态。\n- 交付清晰组件边界、已记录的设计令牌、可运行构建和精简设备宽度检查记录。"
