    "summary": "这是一个面向“Portfolio”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 editorial art direction、controlled luminous accents，并以“a continuously looping marquee”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合 Portfolio 类官网首屏、活动主视觉、作品集入口或产品发布页。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement a personal creative profile with a concise introduction, selected work strip, skill evidence, current availability, and direct contact. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nFRONTEND FOUNDATION\nThe delivery stack is React 19, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS v4, motion/react, and lucide-react; avoid adding a backend or unrelated packages.\nReference scope: a high-impact hero section with navigation, a concise value proposition, primary and secondary actions, and a visual focal point. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nLOOK AND FEEL\n- Compose the page with a horizontal showcase track; express that structure through editorial art direction; controlled luminous accents.\n- Turn #efeee9, #141414 into named CSS design tokens; use Inter to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1180px content width, a spacious spacing rhythm, and roughly 12px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nCORE SURFACES\n1. Concentrate the opening viewport on a personal creative profile with a concise introduction, selected work strip, skill evidence, current availability, and direct contact, with one dominant promise, supporting explanation, primary action, secondary route, and visual proof.\n2. Expose just enough adjacent content to signal what follows; do not turn the hero into a generic feature dashboard or duplicate the same message in multiple cards.\n3. The value proposition and primary action must remain complete when decorative media and advanced motion are unavailable.\n\nINTERACTION MODEL\n- Use a continuously looping marquee, purposeful hover feedback, staggered entrance transitions to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 280–420ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Keep animation on composited properties, stop ambient sequences when offscreen, and never make reading wait for a reveal to finish.\n- Test the complete flow with keyboard input; when prefers-reduced-motion is active, disable looping, parallax, and depth effects without hiding content.\n\nLAYOUT TRANSITIONS\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nREVIEW CHECKLIST\n- Apply WCAG AA to text and controls, preserve source order, label every input, and provide meaningful alternative text only where imagery carries information.\n- Test all calls to action, external routes, expandable regions, and failure fallbacks; the finished interface must produce no clipping or runtime errors.\n- Keep data and presentation typed, consolidate repeated styles, and include a README with setup plus responsive and reduced-motion verification.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现包含精炼个人介绍、精选作品条带、能力证据、当前档期和直接联系的个人创意档案。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n前端基础\n固定技术栈为 React 19、TypeScript、Vite、Tailwind CSS v4、motion/react 和 lucide-react；不要增加后端或无关依赖。\n参考范围：包含导航、精炼价值主张、主次操作和视觉焦点的高冲击首屏。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n观感定义\n- 主体构图采用横向展示轨道；视觉语言由编辑式视觉指导、克制的发光强调构成。\n- 把 #efeee9, #141414 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1180px，采用宽松的间距节奏，基础圆角约 12px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n核心界面\n1. 把首屏集中在包含精炼个人介绍、精选作品条带、能力证据、当前档期和直接联系的个人创意档案，包含一个主承诺、支持解释、主操作、次级路径和视觉证明。\n2. 只露出足够的后续内容提示页面走向，不要把首屏做成通用功能仪表盘，也不要在多张卡片里重复同一信息。\n3. 装饰媒体和高级动画不可用时，价值主张与主操作仍必须完整成立。\n\n交互模型\n- 使用连续循环跑马灯、有明确意图的悬停反馈、错峰入场过渡突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 280–420ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 只在合成属性上运行动画，元素离开视口后停止环境效果，不得让用户等待揭示动画结束才能阅读。\n- 使用键盘完成全部流程；prefers-reduced-motion 启用时关闭循环、视差和景深，但不能隐藏内容。\n\n布局转换\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n评审清单\n- 文字与控件达到 WCAG AA，保留合理源码顺序，给每个输入项添加标签，仅为承载信息的图片提供替代文本。\n- 检查所有操作、外部路径、展开区域和失败回退；完成界面不得出现裁切或运行时错误。\n- 保持数据和展示强类型，合并重复样式，并在 README 中记录配置、响应式和减少动态效果验收。"
