    "summary": "这是一个面向“About”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 dark high-contrast palette、subtle directional gradients，并以“scroll-linked progression”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合将独立的 About 模块加入现有营销站、产品页或作品集。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement a personal about section combining portrait, short biography, experience timeline, selected disciplines, values, and availability. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nRUNTIME BOUNDARY\nShip this as a React 19 + TypeScript application running on Vite, with Tailwind CSS v4 design tokens, motion/react transitions, and lucide-react controls.\nReference scope: an editorial company story with a concise mission, evidence, and human context. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nART-DIRECTION NOTES\n- Compose the page with a centered focal composition; express that structure through dark high-contrast palette; subtle directional gradients.\n- Turn #0C0C0C, #646973, #BBCCD7, #D7E2EA into named CSS design tokens; use a clean humanist sans-serif with tabular numerals to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1320px content width, a compact but breathable spacing rhythm, and roughly 20px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nINFORMATION FLOW\n1. Build one reusable section around a personal about section combining portrait, short biography, experience timeline, selected disciplines, values, and availability, with typed content props and no dependency on the surrounding page theme.\n2. Provide a complete default example, a clear section heading hierarchy, and enough outer spacing for the component to sit between unrelated sections.\n3. Keep the section focused on one job; do not expand it into a generic page, navigation shell, or invented product suite.\n\nMICROINTERACTIONS\n- Use scroll-linked progression, purposeful hover feedback, masked content reveals to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 180–240ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Treat motion as information: entrances establish hierarchy, direct manipulation responds immediately, and exits never delay the next task.\n- Mirror every pointer path with keyboard controls and visible focus; prefers-reduced-motion must replace spatial travel with stable fades or instant state changes.\n\nSCREEN-SIZE RULES\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nRELEASE STANDARD\n- Meet WCAG AA with semantic landmarks, correctly associated labels, visible focus, and alternatives for meaningful media.\n- Exercise primary, empty, loading, success, and failure paths; remove broken links, clipped text, page-level overflow, and console errors.\n- Keep component boundaries typed, document install and run steps, and state which 360px, 768px, and 1440px checks were completed.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现把人物肖像、简短传记、经历时间线、精选专业、价值观和档期结合起来的个人介绍模块。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n运行边界\n以 React 19 + TypeScript 应用交付，运行于 Vite，使用 Tailwind CSS v4 设计令牌、motion/react 过渡和 lucide-react 控件。\n参考范围：包含精炼使命、证据和人物语境的编辑式公司故事。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n艺术指导说明\n- 主体构图采用居中的视觉焦点构图；视觉语言由深色高对比配色、细微方向性渐变构成。\n- 把 #0C0C0C, #646973, #BBCCD7, #D7E2EA 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 带等宽数字的人文无衬线字体 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1320px，采用紧凑但有呼吸感的间距节奏，基础圆角约 20px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n信息流\n1. 围绕把人物肖像、简短传记、经历时间线、精选专业、价值观和档期结合起来的个人介绍模块构建单一可复用模块，内容通过强类型属性传入，不依赖外部页面主题。\n2. 提供完整默认示例、清楚标题层级和足够外边距，使组件能嵌入互不相关的页面区块之间。\n3. 模块只完成一个任务，不要扩展成通用整页、导航框架或虚构产品套件。\n\n微交互\n- 使用与滚动进度联动的动画、有明确意图的悬停反馈、遮罩式内容揭示突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 180–240ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 把动画当作信息：入场建立层级，直接操作立即响应，退场不得拖延下一任务。\n- 每条指针路径都要有键盘操作和可见焦点；prefers-reduced-motion 用稳定淡入或即时状态变化替代空间位移。\n\n屏幕尺寸规则\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n发布标准\n- 通过语义地标、正确关联的标签、可见焦点和有意义媒体的替代信息达到 WCAG AA。\n- 覆盖主流程、空、加载、成功和失败路径，消除失效链接、文字裁切、页面横向溢出和控制台错误。\n- 保持组件边界强类型，记录安装与运行步骤，并注明完成的 360px、768px 和 1440px 检查。"
