    "summary": "这是一个面向“SaaS”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 subtle directional gradients，并以“purposeful hover feedback”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合 SaaS 类官网首屏、活动主视觉、作品集入口或产品发布页。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement a data-security platform hero with protected-asset map, live risk posture, policy automation, compliance proof, and assessment request. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nENGINEERING SCOPE\nBuild a runnable Vite frontend with React 19 and TypeScript; style it in Tailwind CSS v4, animate it with motion/react, and source functional icons from lucide-react.\nReference scope: a high-impact hero section with navigation, a concise value proposition, primary and secondary actions, and a visual focal point. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nCOMPOSITION AND TYPE\n- Compose the page with a full-viewport opening composition; express that structure through subtle directional gradients.\n- Turn #ffffff into named CSS design tokens; use Inter to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1440px content width, a highly structured spacing rhythm, and roughly 24px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nPAGE SEQUENCE\n1. Concentrate the opening viewport on a data-security platform hero with protected-asset map, live risk posture, policy automation, compliance proof, and assessment request, with one dominant promise, supporting explanation, primary action, secondary route, and visual proof.\n2. Expose just enough adjacent content to signal what follows; do not turn the hero into a generic feature dashboard or duplicate the same message in multiple cards.\n3. The value proposition and primary action must remain complete when decorative media and advanced motion are unavailable.\n\nMOTION DIRECTION\n- Use purposeful hover feedback, staggered entrance transitions, slow ambient floating motion to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 220–320ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Choreograph entry, interaction, and exit as separate states, using transforms and opacity so the interface stays responsive under load.\n- Confirm keyboard parity for hover-only discoveries and expose the same information in a stable prefers-reduced-motion presentation.\n\nMOBILE AND DESKTOP\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nSHIP CRITERIA\n- Meet WCAG AA with semantic landmarks, correctly associated labels, visible focus, and alternatives for meaningful media.\n- Exercise primary, empty, loading, success, and failure paths; remove broken links, clipped text, page-level overflow, and console errors.\n- Keep component boundaries typed, document install and run steps, and state which 360px, 768px, and 1440px checks were completed.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现包含受保护资产地图、实时风险态势、策略自动化、合规证明和评估申请的数据安全平台首屏。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n工程范围\n交付可运行的 React 19 与 TypeScript Vite 前端；使用 Tailwind CSS v4 编写样式、motion/react 编排动画、lucide-react 提供功能图标。\n参考范围：包含导航、精炼价值主张、主次操作和视觉焦点的高冲击首屏。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n构图与字体\n- 主体构图采用占满首屏的开场构图；视觉语言由细微方向性渐变构成。\n- 把 #ffffff 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1440px，采用高度结构化的间距节奏，基础圆角约 24px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n页面序列\n1. 把首屏集中在包含受保护资产地图、实时风险态势、策略自动化、合规证明和评估申请的数据安全平台首屏，包含一个主承诺、支持解释、主操作、次级路径和视觉证明。\n2. 只露出足够的后续内容提示页面走向，不要把首屏做成通用功能仪表盘，也不要在多张卡片里重复同一信息。\n3. 装饰媒体和高级动画不可用时，价值主张与主操作仍必须完整成立。\n\n动态方向\n- 使用有明确意图的悬停反馈、错峰入场过渡、缓慢环境漂浮动画突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 220–320ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 把入场、交互和退场拆成独立状态，使用 transform 与 opacity 保证负载下仍流畅。\n- 为仅悬停可见的信息提供键盘等价路径，并在 prefers-reduced-motion 中稳定展示相同内容。\n\n手机与桌面\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n交付条件\n- 通过语义地标、正确关联的标签、可见焦点和有意义媒体的替代信息达到 WCAG AA。\n- 覆盖主流程、空、加载、成功和失败路径，消除失效链接、文字裁切、页面横向溢出和控制台错误。\n- 保持组件边界强类型，记录安装与运行步骤，并注明完成的 360px、768px 和 1440px 检查。"
