    "prompt": "Design and implement an AI monitoring hero with sentinel-like visual focus, detection stream, prioritized findings, explainable response, and guided deployment. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nIMPLEMENTATION CONTRACT\nCreate a clean React 19 + TypeScript + Vite implementation. Use Tailwind CSS v4, motion/react, and lucide-react as the only presentation essentials.\nReference scope: a high-impact hero section with navigation, a concise value proposition, primary and secondary actions, and a visual focal point. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nVISUAL READING\n- Compose the page with a full-viewport opening composition; express that structure through dark high-contrast palette.\n- Turn deep navy, cool gray, and luminous cyan into named CSS design tokens; use Inter with Sora to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1180px content width, a spacious spacing rhythm, and roughly 12px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nEXPERIENCE BLUEPRINT\n1. Concentrate the opening viewport on an AI monitoring hero with sentinel-like visual focus, detection stream, prioritized findings, explainable response, and guided deployment, with one dominant promise, supporting explanation, primary action, secondary route, and visual proof.\n2. Expose just enough adjacent content to signal what follows; do not turn the hero into a generic feature dashboard or duplicate the same message in multiple cards.\n3. The value proposition and primary action must remain complete when decorative media and advanced motion are unavailable.\n\nMOTION CHOREOGRAPHY\n- Use a restrained pointer-following effect, purposeful hover feedback, staggered entrance transitions to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 280–420ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Choreograph entry, interaction, and exit as separate states, using transforms and opacity so the interface stays responsive under load.\n- Confirm keyboard parity for hover-only discoveries and expose the same information in a stable prefers-reduced-motion presentation.\n\nRESPONSIVE TRANSFORMATION\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nACCEPTANCE CHECKS\n- Use semantic elements and WCAG AA contrast, expose visible focus at every stop, and announce asynchronous state changes to assistive technology.\n- Validate the intended conversion or task path from first action to completion, including disabled, error, retry, and media-unavailable states.\n- Ship clean component boundaries, documented design tokens, a runnable build, and a compact record of device-width checks.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现包含哨兵式视觉焦点、检测流、优先发现、可解释响应和引导部署的 AI 监控首屏。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n实施约束\n构建整洁的 React 19 + TypeScript + Vite 实现，展示层只使用 Tailwind CSS v4、motion/react 和 lucide-react。\n参考范围：包含导航、精炼价值主张、主次操作和视觉焦点的高冲击首屏。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n视觉解读\n- 主体构图采用占满首屏的开场构图；视觉语言由深色高对比配色构成。\n- 把 deep navy, cool gray, and luminous cyan 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter with Sora 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1180px，采用宽松的间距节奏，基础圆角约 12px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n体验结构\n1. 把首屏集中在包含哨兵式视觉焦点、检测流、优先发现、可解释响应和引导部署的 AI 监控首屏，包含一个主承诺、支持解释、主操作、次级路径和视觉证明。\n2. 只露出足够的后续内容提示页面走向，不要把首屏做成通用功能仪表盘，也不要在多张卡片里重复同一信息。\n3. 装饰媒体和高级动画不可用时，价值主张与主操作仍必须完整成立。\n\n动画编排\n- 使用克制的指针跟随、有明确意图的悬停反馈、错峰入场过渡突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 280–420ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 把入场、交互和退场拆成独立状态，使用 transform 与 opacity 保证负载下仍流畅。\n- 为仅悬停可见的信息提供键盘等价路径，并在 prefers-reduced-motion 中稳定展示相同内容。\n\n响应式转化\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n验收检查\n- 使用语义元素和 WCAG AA 对比度，让每个焦点位置清楚可见，并向辅助技术播报异步状态变化。\n- 从首次操作到完成验收目标转化或任务路径，覆盖禁用、错误、重试和媒体不可用状态。\n- 交付清晰组件边界、已记录的设计令牌、可运行构建和精简设备宽度检查记录。"
