    "summary": "这是一个面向“404”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 controlled luminous accents、subtle directional gradients，并以“purposeful hover feedback”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合 404 类官网首屏、活动主视觉、作品集入口或产品发布页。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement an aviation-themed not-found page with a broken route metaphor, flight-style status panel, destination shortcuts, and return-to-terminal action. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nENGINEERING SCOPE\nUse React 19 + TypeScript on Vite, Tailwind CSS v4 for layout tokens, motion/react for purposeful animation, and lucide-react for interface icons.\nReference scope: a high-impact hero section with navigation, a concise value proposition, primary and secondary actions, and a visual focal point. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nCOMPOSITION AND TYPE\n- Compose the page with a full-viewport opening composition; a centered focal composition; express that structure through controlled luminous accents; subtle directional gradients.\n- Turn deep navy, cool gray, and luminous cyan into named CSS design tokens; use Inter with Geist to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1240px content width, an editorially paced spacing rhythm, and roughly 16px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nPAGE SEQUENCE\n1. Make the failure state itself useful: stage an aviation-themed not-found page with a broken route metaphor, flight-style status panel, destination shortcuts, and return-to-terminal action, then present the recovery choices in the first keyboard tab sequence.\n2. Keep the status message, search or destination shortcuts, and primary return action visually separate so the user never reaches a dead end.\n3. Do not invent a full marketing site around the error; make one memorable screen and a compact navigation fallback.\n\nMOTION DIRECTION\n- Use purposeful hover feedback to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 320–520ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Treat motion as information: entrances establish hierarchy, direct manipulation responds immediately, and exits never delay the next task.\n- Mirror every pointer path with keyboard controls and visible focus; prefers-reduced-motion must replace spatial travel with stable fades or instant state changes.\n\nMOBILE AND DESKTOP\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nSHIP CRITERIA\n- Use semantic HTML, visible focus, accurate labels, and descriptive alternatives; text and controls must meet WCAG AA and no state may rely on color alone.\n- Verify the core flow: every button and link works, media failure has a fallback, long content never clips, and the console stays error-free.\n- Reuse typed components and design tokens instead of duplicating layout code; deliver a runnable project, a short README, and recorded breakpoint checks.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现包含中断航线隐喻、航班式状态面板、目的地捷径和返回航站楼操作的航空主题 404 页面。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n工程范围\n采用 React 19 + TypeScript + Vite，使用 Tailwind CSS v4 管理布局令牌、motion/react 实现有意义的动画、lucide-react 提供界面图标。\n参考范围：包含导航、精炼价值主张、主次操作和视觉焦点的高冲击首屏。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n构图与字体\n- 主体构图采用占满首屏的开场构图、居中的视觉焦点构图；视觉语言由克制的发光强调、细微方向性渐变构成。\n- 把 deep navy, cool gray, and luminous cyan 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter with Geist 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1240px，采用具有编辑节奏的间距节奏，基础圆角约 16px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n页面序列\n1. 让失败状态本身有用：以包含中断航线隐喻、航班式状态面板、目的地捷径和返回航站楼操作的航空主题 404 页面建立记忆点，并把恢复选项放进最先到达的键盘焦点顺序。\n2. 明确区分状态说明、搜索或目的地捷径和主返回操作，避免用户进入真正的死路。\n3. 不要围绕错误页虚构完整营销网站；只构建一个有记忆点的屏幕和精简导航回退。\n\n动态方向\n- 使用有明确意图的悬停反馈突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 320–520ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 把动画当作信息：入场建立层级，直接操作立即响应，退场不得拖延下一任务。\n- 每条指针路径都要有键盘操作和可见焦点；prefers-reduced-motion 用稳定淡入或即时状态变化替代空间位移。\n\n手机与桌面\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n交付条件\n- 使用语义化 HTML、可见焦点、准确标签和描述性替代文本；文字与控件达到 WCAG AA，状态不能只依赖颜色。\n- 验收核心流程：所有按钮和链接可用，媒体失败有回退，长内容不裁切，控制台无错误。\n- 复用强类型组件与设计令牌，避免重复布局代码；交付可运行项目、简短 README 和断点检查记录。"
