    "summary": "这是一个面向“Hero Section”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 bright neutral canvas、subtle directional gradients，并以“purposeful hover feedback”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合 Hero Section 类官网首屏、活动主视觉、作品集入口或产品发布页。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement a space-scaled AI platform hero with constellation-like model connections, capability orbit, output preview, trust proof, and launch action. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nBUILD BASIS\nUse React 19 + TypeScript on Vite, Tailwind CSS v4 for layout tokens, motion/react for purposeful animation, and lucide-react for interface icons.\nReference scope: a high-impact hero section with navigation, a concise value proposition, primary and secondary actions, and a visual focal point. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nART DIRECTION\n- Compose the page with a centered focal composition; express that structure through bright neutral canvas; subtle directional gradients.\n- Turn near-black, warm white, and electric blue into named CSS design tokens; use Inter to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1240px content width, an editorially paced spacing rhythm, and roughly 16px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nINTERFACE ANATOMY\n1. Concentrate the opening viewport on a space-scaled AI platform hero with constellation-like model connections, capability orbit, output preview, trust proof, and launch action, with one dominant promise, supporting explanation, primary action, secondary route, and visual proof.\n2. Expose just enough adjacent content to signal what follows; do not turn the hero into a generic feature dashboard or duplicate the same message in multiple cards.\n3. The value proposition and primary action must remain complete when decorative media and advanced motion are unavailable.\n\nINTERACTION RHYTHM\n- Use purposeful hover feedback, staggered entrance transitions, animated tab switching to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 320–520ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Limit simultaneous animation layers, pause media outside the viewport, and reserve emphasis motion for the element that changed state.\n- Maintain logical keyboard order and visible focus through every transition; prefers-reduced-motion should produce an equally legible non-animated path.\n\nBREAKPOINT BEHAVIOR\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nDEFINITION OF DONE\n- Apply WCAG AA to text and controls, preserve source order, label every input, and provide meaningful alternative text only where imagery carries information.\n- Test all calls to action, external routes, expandable regions, and failure fallbacks; the finished interface must produce no clipping or runtime errors.\n- Keep data and presentation typed, consolidate repeated styles, and include a README with setup plus responsive and reduced-motion verification.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现包含星座式模型连接、能力轨道、输出预览、信任证明和启动操作的宇宙尺度 AI 平台首屏。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n构建基础\n采用 React 19 + TypeScript + Vite，使用 Tailwind CSS v4 管理布局令牌、motion/react 实现有意义的动画、lucide-react 提供界面图标。\n参考范围：包含导航、精炼价值主张、主次操作和视觉焦点的高冲击首屏。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n美术方向\n- 主体构图采用居中的视觉焦点构图；视觉语言由明亮中性画布、细微方向性渐变构成。\n- 把 near-black, warm white, and electric blue 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1240px，采用具有编辑节奏的间距节奏，基础圆角约 16px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n界面组成\n1. 把首屏集中在包含星座式模型连接、能力轨道、输出预览、信任证明和启动操作的宇宙尺度 AI 平台首屏，包含一个主承诺、支持解释、主操作、次级路径和视觉证明。\n2. 只露出足够的后续内容提示页面走向，不要把首屏做成通用功能仪表盘，也不要在多张卡片里重复同一信息。\n3. 装饰媒体和高级动画不可用时，价值主张与主操作仍必须完整成立。\n\n交互节奏\n- 使用有明确意图的悬停反馈、错峰入场过渡、标签页切换动画突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 320–520ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 限制同时运行动画的层数，暂停视口外媒体，只让发生状态变化的元素获得强调。\n- 所有过渡保持合理键盘顺序和可见焦点；prefers-reduced-motion 提供同样清晰的无动画路径。\n\n断点行为\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n完成标准\n- 文字与控件达到 WCAG AA，保留合理源码顺序，给每个输入项添加标签，仅为承载信息的图片提供替代文本。\n- 检查所有操作、外部路径、展开区域和失败回退；完成界面不得出现裁切或运行时错误。\n- 保持数据和展示强类型，合并重复样式，并在 README 中记录配置、响应式和减少动态效果验收。"
