    "summary": "这是一个面向“Hero”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 restrained minimalist styling、subtle directional gradients、quiet premium detailing，并以“a continuously looping marquee”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合 Hero 类官网首屏、活动主视觉、作品集入口或产品发布页。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement a subscription design agency page with monthly deliverables, request queue preview, plan boundaries, turnaround proof, and membership start. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nFRONTEND FOUNDATION\nImplement with React 19, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS v4, motion/react, and lucide-react. Keep the component tree typed and frontend-only.\nReference scope: a high-impact hero section with navigation, a concise value proposition, primary and secondary actions, and a visual focal point. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nLOOK AND FEEL\n- Compose the page with a full-viewport opening composition; a centered focal composition; express that structure through restrained minimalist styling; subtle directional gradients; quiet premium detailing.\n- Turn #ffffff, #0a0a0a, #6b6b6b, #17c964 into named CSS design tokens; use Inter to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1440px content width, a highly structured spacing rhythm, and roughly 24px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nCORE SURFACES\n1. Concentrate the opening viewport on a subscription design agency page with monthly deliverables, request queue preview, plan boundaries, turnaround proof, and membership start, with one dominant promise, supporting explanation, primary action, secondary route, and visual proof.\n2. Expose just enough adjacent content to signal what follows; do not turn the hero into a generic feature dashboard or duplicate the same message in multiple cards.\n3. The value proposition and primary action must remain complete when decorative media and advanced motion are unavailable.\n\nINTERACTION MODEL\n- Use a continuously looping marquee, purposeful hover feedback, staggered entrance transitions to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 220–320ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Animate transforms and opacity instead of layout-heavy properties; provide immediate hover, focus, pressed, selected, loading, success, and failure feedback where the flow needs it.\n- Keyboard users must reach the same outcomes as pointer users; under prefers-reduced-motion, remove parallax, autoplay loops, and large travel while preserving state changes.\n\nLAYOUT TRANSITIONS\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nREVIEW CHECKLIST\n- Meet WCAG AA with semantic landmarks, correctly associated labels, visible focus, and alternatives for meaningful media.\n- Exercise primary, empty, loading, success, and failure paths; remove broken links, clipped text, page-level overflow, and console errors.\n- Keep component boundaries typed, document install and run steps, and state which 360px, 768px, and 1440px checks were completed.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现包含月度交付物、需求队列预览、方案边界、周转时间证明和会员开始入口的订阅式设计机构页面。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n前端基础\n使用 React 19、TypeScript、Vite、Tailwind CSS v4、motion/react 和 lucide-react 实现；组件树保持强类型且仅包含前端能力。\n参考范围：包含导航、精炼价值主张、主次操作和视觉焦点的高冲击首屏。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n观感定义\n- 主体构图采用占满首屏的开场构图、居中的视觉焦点构图；视觉语言由克制的极简风格、细微方向性渐变、安静克制的高级细节构成。\n- 把 #ffffff, #0a0a0a, #6b6b6b, #17c964 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1440px，采用高度结构化的间距节奏，基础圆角约 24px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n核心界面\n1. 把首屏集中在包含月度交付物、需求队列预览、方案边界、周转时间证明和会员开始入口的订阅式设计机构页面，包含一个主承诺、支持解释、主操作、次级路径和视觉证明。\n2. 只露出足够的后续内容提示页面走向，不要把首屏做成通用功能仪表盘，也不要在多张卡片里重复同一信息。\n3. 装饰媒体和高级动画不可用时，价值主张与主操作仍必须完整成立。\n\n交互模型\n- 使用连续循环跑马灯、有明确意图的悬停反馈、错峰入场过渡突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 220–320ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 优先动画 transform 与 opacity，不动画高成本布局属性；按流程需要提供即时悬停、焦点、按下、选中、加载、成功和失败反馈。\n- 键盘用户必须得到与指针用户相同的结果；prefers-reduced-motion 下移除视差、自动循环和大幅位移，同时保留状态变化。\n\n布局转换\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n评审清单\n- 通过语义地标、正确关联的标签、可见焦点和有意义媒体的替代信息达到 WCAG AA。\n- 覆盖主流程、空、加载、成功和失败路径，消除失效链接、文字裁切、页面横向溢出和控制台错误。\n- 保持组件边界强类型，记录安装与运行步骤，并注明完成的 360px、768px 和 1440px 检查。"
