    "previewType": "image",
    "verifiedAt": "2026-08-17",
    "summary": "这是一个面向“Hero Section”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 layered frosted-glass surfaces、dark high-contrast palette、controlled luminous accents，并以“purposeful hover feedback”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合 Hero Section 类官网首屏、活动主视觉、作品集入口或产品发布页。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement a task-management hero with today view, priority grouping, collaborative updates, completion rhythm, and a frictionless first-project action. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nBUILD BASIS\nThe delivery stack is React 19, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS v4, motion/react, and lucide-react; avoid adding a backend or unrelated packages.\nReference scope: a high-impact hero section with navigation, a concise value proposition, primary and secondary actions, and a visual focal point. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nART DIRECTION\n- Compose the page with a centered focal composition; express that structure through layered frosted-glass surfaces; dark high-contrast palette; controlled luminous accents; subtle directional gradients.\n- Turn #60B1FF, #319AFF, #FF801E into named CSS design tokens; use Inter to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1240px content width, an editorially paced spacing rhythm, and roughly 16px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nINTERFACE ANATOMY\n1. Concentrate the opening viewport on a task-management hero with today view, priority grouping, collaborative updates, completion rhythm, and a frictionless first-project action, with one dominant promise, supporting explanation, primary action, secondary route, and visual proof.\n2. Expose just enough adjacent content to signal what follows; do not turn the hero into a generic feature dashboard or duplicate the same message in multiple cards.\n3. The value proposition and primary action must remain complete when decorative media and advanced motion are unavailable.\n\nINTERACTION RHYTHM\n- Use purposeful hover feedback, sticky sectional storytelling to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 320–520ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Choreograph entry, interaction, and exit as separate states, using transforms and opacity so the interface stays responsive under load.\n- Confirm keyboard parity for hover-only discoveries and expose the same information in a stable prefers-reduced-motion presentation.\n\nBREAKPOINT BEHAVIOR\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nDEFINITION OF DONE\n- Use semantic HTML, visible focus, accurate labels, and descriptive alternatives; text and controls must meet WCAG AA and no state may rely on color alone.\n- Verify the core flow: every button and link works, media failure has a fallback, long content never clips, and the console stays error-free.\n- Reuse typed components and design tokens instead of duplicating layout code; deliver a runnable project, a short README, and recorded breakpoint checks.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现包含今日视图、优先级分组、协作更新、完成节奏和低摩擦首个项目操作的任务管理首屏。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n构建基础\n固定技术栈为 React 19、TypeScript、Vite、Tailwind CSS v4、motion/react 和 lucide-react；不要增加后端或无关依赖。\n参考范围：包含导航、精炼价值主张、主次操作和视觉焦点的高冲击首屏。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n美术方向\n- 主体构图采用居中的视觉焦点构图；视觉语言由有层次的磨砂玻璃表面、深色高对比配色、克制的发光强调、细微方向性渐变构成。\n- 把 #60B1FF, #319AFF, #FF801E 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1240px，采用具有编辑节奏的间距节奏，基础圆角约 16px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n界面组成\n1. 把首屏集中在包含今日视图、优先级分组、协作更新、完成节奏和低摩擦首个项目操作的任务管理首屏，包含一个主承诺、支持解释、主操作、次级路径和视觉证明。\n2. 只露出足够的后续内容提示页面走向，不要把首屏做成通用功能仪表盘，也不要在多张卡片里重复同一信息。\n3. 装饰媒体和高级动画不可用时，价值主张与主操作仍必须完整成立。\n\n交互节奏\n- 使用有明确意图的悬停反馈、粘性分段叙事突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 320–520ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 把入场、交互和退场拆成独立状态，使用 transform 与 opacity 保证负载下仍流畅。\n- 为仅悬停可见的信息提供键盘等价路径，并在 prefers-reduced-motion 中稳定展示相同内容。\n\n断点行为\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n完成标准\n- 使用语义化 HTML、可见焦点、准确标签和描述性替代文本；文字与控件达到 WCAG AA，状态不能只依赖颜色。\n- 验收核心流程：所有按钮和链接可用，媒体失败有回退，长内容不裁切，控制台无错误。\n- 复用强类型组件与设计令牌，避免重复布局代码；交付可运行项目、简短 README 和断点检查记录。"
