    "summary": "这是一个面向“Hero Section”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 layered frosted-glass surfaces、dark high-contrast palette、subtle directional gradients，并以“purposeful hover feedback”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合 Hero Section 类官网首屏、活动主视觉、作品集入口或产品发布页。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement a venture fund hero connecting an investment thesis to founder momentum, sector map, portfolio signals, and pitch submission. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nPRODUCTION RULES\nImplement with React 19, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS v4, motion/react, and lucide-react. Keep the component tree typed and frontend-only.\nReference scope: a high-impact hero section with navigation, a concise value proposition, primary and secondary actions, and a visual focal point. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nVISUAL LANGUAGE\n- Compose the page with a full-viewport opening composition; express that structure through layered frosted-glass surfaces; dark high-contrast palette; subtle directional gradients.\n- Turn graphite, silver, and warm amber into named CSS design tokens; use Inter to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1240px content width, an editorially paced spacing rhythm, and roughly 16px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nCONTENT ARCHITECTURE\n1. Concentrate the opening viewport on a venture fund hero connecting an investment thesis to founder momentum, sector map, portfolio signals, and pitch submission, with one dominant promise, supporting explanation, primary action, secondary route, and visual proof.\n2. Expose just enough adjacent content to signal what follows; do not turn the hero into a generic feature dashboard or duplicate the same message in multiple cards.\n3. The value proposition and primary action must remain complete when decorative media and advanced motion are unavailable.\n\nBEHAVIOR AND FEEDBACK\n- Use purposeful hover feedback, staggered entrance transitions to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 320–520ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Treat motion as information: entrances establish hierarchy, direct manipulation responds immediately, and exits never delay the next task.\n- Mirror every pointer path with keyboard controls and visible focus; prefers-reduced-motion must replace spatial travel with stable fades or instant state changes.\n\nRESPONSIVE STRATEGY\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nFINAL VERIFICATION\n- Use semantic HTML, visible focus, accurate labels, and descriptive alternatives; text and controls must meet WCAG AA and no state may rely on color alone.\n- Verify the core flow: every button and link works, media failure has a fallback, long content never clips, and the console stays error-free.\n- Reuse typed components and design tokens instead of duplicating layout code; deliver a runnable project, a short README, and recorded breakpoint checks.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现把投资论点、创始人势能、行业地图、投资组合信号和项目提交入口连接起来的风投基金首屏。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n生产规则\n使用 React 19、TypeScript、Vite、Tailwind CSS v4、motion/react 和 lucide-react 实现；组件树保持强类型且仅包含前端能力。\n参考范围：包含导航、精炼价值主张、主次操作和视觉焦点的高冲击首屏。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n视觉语言\n- 主体构图采用占满首屏的开场构图；视觉语言由有层次的磨砂玻璃表面、深色高对比配色、细微方向性渐变构成。\n- 把 graphite, silver, and warm amber 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1240px，采用具有编辑节奏的间距节奏，基础圆角约 16px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n内容架构\n1. 把首屏集中在把投资论点、创始人势能、行业地图、投资组合信号和项目提交入口连接起来的风投基金首屏，包含一个主承诺、支持解释、主操作、次级路径和视觉证明。\n2. 只露出足够的后续内容提示页面走向，不要把首屏做成通用功能仪表盘，也不要在多张卡片里重复同一信息。\n3. 装饰媒体和高级动画不可用时，价值主张与主操作仍必须完整成立。\n\n行为与反馈\n- 使用有明确意图的悬停反馈、错峰入场过渡突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 320–520ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 把动画当作信息：入场建立层级，直接操作立即响应，退场不得拖延下一任务。\n- 每条指针路径都要有键盘操作和可见焦点；prefers-reduced-motion 用稳定淡入或即时状态变化替代空间位移。\n\n响应式策略\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n最终核验\n- 使用语义化 HTML、可见焦点、准确标签和描述性替代文本；文字与控件达到 WCAG AA，状态不能只依赖颜色。\n- 验收核心流程：所有按钮和链接可用，媒体失败有回退，长内容不裁切，控制台无错误。\n- 复用强类型组件与设计令牌，避免重复布局代码；交付可运行项目、简短 README 和断点检查记录。"
