    "summary": "这是一个面向“Hero”场景的原创等效前端方案，保留公开预览所体现的 subtle directional gradients，并以“a restrained pointer-following effect”作为主要动态线索。实现时使用中性品牌和重新编写的文案，不复刻原站提示词。",
    "scenario": "适合 Hero 类官网首屏、活动主视觉、作品集入口或产品发布页。",
    "prompt": "Design and implement a visual-discovery hero where an obscured scene progressively reveals product meaning, comparison controls, detail hotspots, and an explore action. Use the public preview only to understand the design type and interaction capability; invent a neutral brand, original copy, and replaceable assets instead of cloning an existing page.\n\nBUILD BASIS\nImplement with React 19, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS v4, motion/react, and lucide-react. Keep the component tree typed and frontend-only.\nReference scope: a high-impact hero section with navigation, a concise value proposition, primary and secondary actions, and a visual focal point. Do not add authentication, databases, analytics, payments, or external services unless the visible experience genuinely needs them.\n\nART DIRECTION\n- Compose the page with a full-viewport opening composition; express that structure through subtle directional gradients.\n- Turn #E4E4E4, #F4F1E8, #75C5DE, #111111 into named CSS design tokens; use Inter to separate display, body, data, and control typography.\n- Target a 1180px content width, a spacious spacing rhythm, and roughly 12px base radii; adjust colors when accessible contrast requires it.\n- Every decorative element must reinforce hierarchy or operation; omit generic gradient blobs, random glass cards, and meaningless icon grids.\n\nINTERFACE ANATOMY\n1. Concentrate the opening viewport on a visual-discovery hero where an obscured scene progressively reveals product meaning, comparison controls, detail hotspots, and an explore action, with one dominant promise, supporting explanation, primary action, secondary route, and visual proof.\n2. Expose just enough adjacent content to signal what follows; do not turn the hero into a generic feature dashboard or duplicate the same message in multiple cards.\n3. The value proposition and primary action must remain complete when decorative media and advanced motion are unavailable.\n\nINTERACTION RHYTHM\n- Use a restrained pointer-following effect, purposeful hover feedback, masked content reveals to stage the focal artifact and clarify state changes; keep ordinary feedback within 280–420ms and reserve longer animation for explicit scene changes.\n- Animate transforms and opacity instead of layout-heavy properties; provide immediate hover, focus, pressed, selected, loading, success, and failure feedback where the flow needs it.\n- Keyboard users must reach the same outcomes as pointer users; under prefers-reduced-motion, remove parallax, autoplay loops, and large travel while preserving state changes.\n\nBREAKPOINT BEHAVIOR\n- Retain the complete hierarchy at 1440px, tighten decoration and spacing at 768px, and use a single reading column with the primary action preserved at 360px.\n- Size media responsively with correct aspect ratios and lazy-load it below the fold; keep 44px touch targets and eliminate page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nDEFINITION OF DONE\n- Maintain WCAG AA contrast, logical heading order, accessible names for icon controls, and status messages that do not depend on color.\n- Confirm that the main task survives missing media, slow loading, long copy, repeated input, and an entirely keyboard-driven session.\n- Return a complete Vite project with shared tokens, reusable components, no unnecessary dependency, and concise operating notes.",
    "promptZh": "请设计并实现让被遮蔽场景逐步揭示产品含义、对比控制、细节热点和探索操作的视觉发现首屏。以公开预览呈现的设计类型和交互能力为依据，但使用全新的中性品牌、原创文案和可替换素材，不得复刻任何现有页面。\n\n构建基础\n使用 React 19、TypeScript、Vite、Tailwind CSS v4、motion/react 和 lucide-react 实现；组件树保持强类型且仅包含前端能力。\n参考范围：包含导航、精炼价值主张、主次操作和视觉焦点的高冲击首屏。除非界面确实需要，否则不要添加登录、数据库、分析、支付或外部服务。\n\n美术方向\n- 主体构图采用占满首屏的开场构图；视觉语言由细微方向性渐变构成。\n- 把 #E4E4E4, #F4F1E8, #75C5DE, #111111 转成命名清楚的 CSS 设计令牌；使用 Inter 建立展示文字、正文、数据和控件层级。\n- 内容最大宽度约 1180px，采用宽松的间距节奏，基础圆角约 12px；需要无障碍对比时允许调整色值。\n- 所有装饰都必须强化信息层级或操作，不添加通用渐变光斑、随机玻璃卡和无意义图标阵列。\n\n界面组成\n1. 把首屏集中在让被遮蔽场景逐步揭示产品含义、对比控制、细节热点和探索操作的视觉发现首屏，包含一个主承诺、支持解释、主操作、次级路径和视觉证明。\n2. 只露出足够的后续内容提示页面走向，不要把首屏做成通用功能仪表盘，也不要在多张卡片里重复同一信息。\n3. 装饰媒体和高级动画不可用时，价值主张与主操作仍必须完整成立。\n\n交互节奏\n- 使用克制的指针跟随、有明确意图的悬停反馈、遮罩式内容揭示突出焦点内容和状态变化；常规反馈控制在 280–420ms，更长动画只用于明确的场景转换。\n- 优先动画 transform 与 opacity，不动画高成本布局属性；按流程需要提供即时悬停、焦点、按下、选中、加载、成功和失败反馈。\n- 键盘用户必须得到与指针用户相同的结果；prefers-reduced-motion 下移除视差、自动循环和大幅位移，同时保留状态变化。\n\n断点行为\n- 在 1440px 保留完整视觉层级，768px 收紧装饰与间距，360px 采用单列阅读顺序并优先保留主操作。\n- 媒体使用响应式尺寸与正确宽高比，首屏以下延迟加载；触控目标至少 44px，页面不得横向溢出。\n\n完成标准\n- 保持 WCAG AA 对比度、合理标题顺序、纯图标控件的可访问名称，以及不依赖颜色的状态信息。\n- 确认主任务在媒体缺失、加载缓慢、长文案、重复输入和全键盘会话下仍可完成。\n- 返回完整 Vite 项目，使用共享令牌和可复用组件，不增加无关依赖，并提供精炼运行说明。"
